and lets get into the Hōrai Arc from Hells

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:15.240
Paradise.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:57.299
After Mei does 

00:01:57.299 --> 00:02:29.400
her thing, Fuchi interprets for the group
and begins explaining the plan they’re about

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.480
to undergo.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:34.910
From what they can learn, Hōrai is designed
to be a massive fortress modeled off China’s

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:38.760
Epang Palace and that the sea monsters prevent
anything from leaving the island.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:43.120
However, Mei reveals that Hōrai contains
numerous ships at a underground floodgate

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.060
that allows departure along a safe current.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:49.700
So their mission is to avoid confrontation,
acquire the elixir and steal a ship to make

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.209
it back home on.

00:02:51.209 --> 00:02:54.790
Gabimaru tells them that according to Mei
the Tan elixir is located in a laboratory,

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:57.950
but the palace's interior is constantly changing.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:02.090
With time drawing closer to the moment they
invade enemy territory, Shion pulls Gabimaru

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:06.840
and Yuzuriha over to have them instruct the
group in the art of espionage using Tao.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:11.090
Looking like an absolute babe with these specs
on Yuzuriha teaches the group on how to mask

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.230
their presence by suppressing their Tao.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:18.370
Afterwards Gabimaru also nerded out, teaches
his lesson in using Tao against their opponents.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:23.060
After the training was over, everyone is divided
into two teams, the Escape-Route Team made

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:28.840
up of big G, Shion, Nurugai, Tōma, Mei, and
Fuchi and the Elixir Retrieval Team made up

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.920
of the other 3.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:34.299
While the 3 powerhouses are off doing there
thing sourcing the elixir, the Escape team

00:03:34.299 --> 00:03:37.310
needs to find the boats and open the flood
gates.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:41.090
Realizing that Mei has wanted to leave the
island for a while now, Gantetsusai suggests

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.730
that they let her depart alone and not wait
for the Elixir Team.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:49.439
However, Gabimaru asks Mei if there was anything
she desired to do before leaving the island.

00:03:49.439 --> 00:03:53.080
Surprisingly Mei tells him that she actually
wished to meet with Rien and Jofuku again

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.630
to ask why they changed from how they were,
before then escaping.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.519
Remembering his wives words to him about valuing
everyday and living a decent life, Gabimaru

00:04:01.519 --> 00:04:04.450
promises to fulfill Mei's wish no matter what.

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:08.379
At a similar time inside of Hōrai, Tao Fa
greets Chōbei after the end of the Doshi

00:04:08.379 --> 00:04:10.980
ritual ceremony but is stopped by Ju Fa.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.790
He cruely tells the other Tensen that there
is no need to communicate with livestock and

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.160
just breathing the same air makes him feel
ill.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:22.820
Angered by his presence Ju Fa lashes out at
Chōbei who manages to block the strike.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:26.120
Realizing just how much stronger he’s become
Chōbei tells the immortal that he should've

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:31.070
finished him off in the last fight, because
now he can see thru all of his moves.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:35.979
Stopping them from further escalating, Rien
orders Ju Fa to behave himself and has Chōbei

00:04:35.979 --> 00:04:38.770
follow him to his laboratory so that he can
study his Tao.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:43.289
As the two walk and talk Chōbei notices that
he is starting to get use to his new power

00:04:43.289 --> 00:04:47.570
but after looking at Rien senses that his
Tao is on a completely different level.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:51.940
Initially he was planning on escaping as quickly
as possible and running back to Tōma, however

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:55.980
after seeing the difference in strength decides
to stick around incase he can find some sort

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.160
of weakness.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:05:01.940
Once entering the laboratory, we see a massive
Waitanhua flower which is called a Banko.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.410
These flowers don't allow them to store the
extra Tan, but unlike the smaller flowers

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:09.540
it can process a far greater quality of Tan
all in one go.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:14.040
The reason Tan cant be preserved is because
over time the Tao eats away at that of the

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:18.560
humans lifeforce, eventually and just like
the human that plant will soon wither before

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.720
it can produce the perfect quality Tan.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:25.310
This is why Rien desires Chōbei's rare Tao,
to complete his research.

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:30.350
Again with Yuki referring to something from
our world, this Banko here or Pangu in Chinese

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.080
is an entity that appears in prominent creation
myth.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.780
In this creation myth it explains that in
a world of nothingness, Banko was the giant

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:42.730
who emerged from his egg, separated Yin and
Yang with his axe, elevated the sky above

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:48.100
the earth and apon his death turned himself
into the sun, moon, landscape, weather and

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.100
animals.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:53.350
Pretty much its the god of earth in this creation
myth and maybe something similar in hells

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.350
paradise.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:59.350
Meanwhile, the Elixir Retrieval Team infiltrates
Hōrai and once safely landing on the roofs,

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:01.980
signals to the others that the area is clear
to enter.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:05.760
Sagiri notices that the plan is moving quickly
and wonders if its truly time for the mission

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.250
to come to an end.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:11.270
Pulling up his mask, Gabimaru States that
they always knew they were on a timer, so

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:14.980
yes everyone will leave this island tonight.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:19.180
Flashing back to the preparation, Fuchi breaks
down Mei’s explanation and gives out a basic

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.620
layout of the castle.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:25.080
He reveals that each Tensen has a sanctuary
of their own and the Elixir and escape ship

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.539
are most likely in the center area.

00:06:27.539 --> 00:06:30.199
Popping in Mei tells us who is in each area
of the castle.

00:06:30.199 --> 00:06:35.490
In here eyes the elixir is most likely with
Rien in the Laboratory, Ju Fa and Tao Fa will

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.310
be doing the silly inside of the Bochu Jutsu
sanctum.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:43.210
The Taisoku sanctum is the domain of Zhu Jin,
Shu’itsu sanctum which is the meditation

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:49.480
domain ruled by Gui Fa and finally the Shuten
sanctum run by Mu Dan but ya know he know

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:53.370
around anymore hahaha.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:57.370
She also states that since the Banko flower
drops down at night, Rien will not be in the

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.050
temple conducting research.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:03.610
Instead he’ll most likely move to the main
residence where Jofuku resides, making it

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:07.729
possible to avoid running into him after securing
the elixir.

00:07:07.729 --> 00:07:10.639
Gabimaru then explains that he and Yuzuriha
will land at the top of the inner gate and

00:07:10.639 --> 00:07:13.570
will survey the layout of the castle using
their Tao sensory.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:18.280
In the present, Sagiri notices the dreadfully
sinister amount of Tao coming from the palace

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.599
and starts to falter.

00:07:19.599 --> 00:07:23.860
Gabi and Yuzuriha though console her stating
that it doesn't bother them as they’re already

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.030
used to it.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:28.569
Using what they’d learnt in preparation
for the mission, both Gabi and Yuzuriha take

00:07:28.569 --> 00:07:33.090
out all of the guards while constantly keeping
their Tao suppressed to not alert anyone.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.720
After taking out all of the Doshi, the Elixir
Retrieval Team successfully make it through

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:39.740
with the first part of their predetermined
plan and enter the castle.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:43.759
Almost instantly after getting inside they
make it to the supposed room with the Elixir.

00:07:43.759 --> 00:07:47.530
Gabimaru opens the door and senses the layout
of the room but suddenly sees Tao forming

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.570
an entity in the middle.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.840
Surprised that someone knew he was there,
the Tao silhouette is revealed to be Ran who

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:56.990
had the same idea of suppressing his Tao.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:02.560
Stepping forth Mei asks her younger brother
how he knew of their arrival.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:07.169
Ran commends their attempt but reveals that
Chōbei has informed them that the humans

00:08:07.169 --> 00:08:11.039
would be coming to invade the palace and agreed
to keep track of their arrival by sensing

00:08:11.039 --> 00:08:13.069
their Tao on one condition.

00:08:13.069 --> 00:08:17.010
This is just due to the fact that after hurting
his brother in the last battle, Chōbei was

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.040
able to track his exact location.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:27.220
Just as if he went up against Zhu Jin Gabimaru
finds himself in trouble due to Ran possessing

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:30.199
the Water-attribute which hinders his Fire-attribute.

00:08:30.199 --> 00:08:34.479
The plan if they bumped into an enemy with
a stronger attribute was to run, as if try

00:08:34.479 --> 00:08:38.010
fighting with such a heavy debuff they’ve
got no chance.

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:42.729
Hoping into a JoJo esque pose Ran becomes
delighted to see Mei once again and begs her

00:08:42.729 --> 00:08:46.380
to return back to their side, explaining that
they no longer need to follow the Outer Way

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:50.260
of Tao since they have completed their research
in creating the Elixir of Life.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.529
Utterly Shocked Gabimaru asks for more info
on what he just said.

00:08:53.529 --> 00:08:58.100
Obviously because of the fact the Tensen discovered
Chōbei they feel that with his co-operation

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.060
they’ll easily be able to create a potent
enough elixir.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:05.840
All that they need to do now is produce more
Tan that has a considerable quantity of exceptional

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:06.840
material.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:11.029
Thats why for this exact reason that Rien
has started the Rite of just consumption,

00:09:11.029 --> 00:09:13.440
the end is indeed coming near.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:18.260
Despite his plea, Mei refuses and says that
she only wishes to say goodbye to everyone.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:22.430
To her now its obvious that she’s different
to them, but dying is sad.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:26.980
Instead she just came to say goodbye before
leaving the island with everyone else.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:30.240
Disappointed Ran just states that the Rite
of Just Consumption would have to continue

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:32.000
and she can become another offering.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:36.850
After Sagiri asks what he meant, Ran explains
that it was ritual to capture and offer the

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.370
humans to the grandmaster.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:44.240
Over with the Boat Squad, Gantetsusai, Fuchi,
and Tōma get separated from Shion and Nurugai

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:47.570
due to a massive cloud of mist that obscures
their vison.

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:51.560
Pushing forward either way the three then
bump into Tao Fa and Ju Fa while Shion and

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:55.580
Nurugai are approached by Zhu Jin for a second
time.

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:58.970
Knowing that their plan to avoid Lord Tensen
has failed, the group decide to move onto

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:03.450
their second plan, which is just straight
hands, giving everything they’ve got cause

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.750
its not like they could ever outrun these
feigns.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.329
Not phased, our boy announces to Ran that
they won't give up without a fight and instead

00:10:09.329 --> 00:10:12.810
they’re beat him down and say bye bye to
this island.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:16.420
Seeing as how the ritual has already begun,
Ran prepares to let loose knowing that all

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.510
they need know is the sacrifices.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:24.890
So I just want you all to think back to the
pot analogy I used at the start of the video

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.890
and how it was literally shown to us on the
panels themselves.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.529
Now think about how what they’re doing with
this elixir is simply another form of this

00:10:31.529 --> 00:10:35.519
old-school Japanese curse, there sticking
all of these ‘venomous beasts’ into the

00:10:35.519 --> 00:10:40.550
island which is literally shaped like a pot
in the hopes they can precure a vial of immortality

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.550
juice.

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:44.540
Idk its something that just clicked in my
head right now, but I love how early on its

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:50.029
foreshadowed that this exact this would happen.

00:10:50.029 --> 00:10:53.630
Knowing that even though he’s going up against
someone with an unfair advantage, Gabimaru

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:57.740
tells Sagiri and Mei to go search for the
elixir while he and Yuzuriha hold off the

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:58.740
creature.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:02.890
However, Mei warns him that they are not in
the Rien’s Temple, shocking Gabimaru.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:06.660
Sensing the kick coming at him from behind
he quickly dodges and jumps back, before flying

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:11.100
forth at the immortal trying to land a kick,
but Ran comfortably weaves out of the way.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:15.510
Hoping into an unrealistically messed up posed,
Ran confirms his sisters comments as he’d

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:17.430
restructured the palace before they arrived.

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:22.630
Apparently the Tao of inorganic material is
even easier to manipulate that of living creatures.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:27.140
Constructing buildings and renovating are
all tasks that actually fall to Ran, so its

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.750
even easier for him to control it than the
others.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.540
With that he creates some spikes from the
floor that trap Mei leaving her with no where

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.760
to run as he slowly closes in.

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:39.930
Needing to protect Mei, Gabimaru decides to
fight Ran but is unable to harm him due to

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.200
not possessing the right attribute.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:45.490
Yuzuriha sees an opening to attack Ran and
throws a Tao imbued kunai.

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:50.000
However, the kunai bounces off of his body
due to Ran cloaking himself in Tao armor.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:55.000
Getting caught off-guard Ran snaps a fat double
kick that pushes both Gabi and Yuzuriha back.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.370
Observing his Tao Gabimaru can visibly seen
the thick layer of armor protecting him from

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.680
any attacks.

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:04.650
The crazy thing about Ran’s armor is that
unlike traditional armor that has holes under

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:10.310
the armpits and other vital spots, Ran has
no gaps at all to exploit.

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:15.350
As he says it, his Tao and muscles are in
perfect harmony, flesh perfected.

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:19.200
Needing to force an opening, Gabi re enters
the battle and fights Ran vertically while

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.760
they both stand on a bunch of massive pillars.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:26.050
Ran jumps at Gabi kicking away a massive chunk
of his pillar, however our man uses this to

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:29.930
his advantage as he picks up the rocks and
activates Ninpo: Stone Storm sending them

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.880
rocketing back at the immortal.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:36.380
Not phased due to the elemental diff, Ran
just returns the ability by kicking them at

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.899
Gabi causing him to drop to the ground.

00:12:37.899 --> 00:12:42.149
Gabimaru then tells Yuzuriha that it was time
to begin their next strategy.

00:12:42.149 --> 00:12:46.089
Confused after hearing this Ran examines his
Tao and notices that nothing has even changed,

00:12:46.089 --> 00:12:48.660
so he cant see how things would also change
in the battle.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:53.639
Ran readies himself to fight Gabimaru how’s
closing in, however, Gabimaru suddenly vanishes

00:12:53.639 --> 00:12:57.560
from his site, before re-appearing and landing
a fat blow that sends the immortal tumbling

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:58.740
across its sanctuary.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:03.889
So back before the mission began Gabimaru
explained that Tao was like a current of water

00:13:03.889 --> 00:13:08.860
flowing around ones body, its even tangible
allowing the user to change the speed, size

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:09.860
and strength.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.680
The attribute you’ve got determines which
direction your energy flows.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:16.740
You have your normal ways of combating opposite
attributes, sadly though the Tao currents

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:22.100
of Lord Tensen are so massive that normal
rules don't apply.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:26.060
Gabimaru theorizes a 3 step process to use
the enemies Tao against themselves.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.820
Firstly you weaken your own energy around
a specific part of your body to take in their

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:30.820
Tao.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:33.949
Then you ride the current so that the boost
of Tao spinning around your body doesn't damage

00:13:33.949 --> 00:13:38.089
you but floats around till you can reverse
its polarity and sent it back straight at

00:13:38.089 --> 00:13:39.089
the opponent.

00:13:39.089 --> 00:13:43.790
In the present, Gabimaru smashes Ran into
the ground by redirecting the Tensen's Tao.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:47.610
He sync’s his breathing with Ran’s and
falls into a place between tranquility and

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:52.690
serenity, finding the middle way allowing
him to ward of incoming blows.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.950
Realizing that even getting grazed by one
of the immortals attacks would be brutal,

00:13:55.950 --> 00:14:00.029
he considers starting the second step to his
plan, but decides to hold off.

00:14:00.029 --> 00:14:04.300
Slowly healing himself Ran becomes impressed
by Gabimaru's skills with Tao, he explains

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:08.230
that the thick clouds of mist tend to activate
a persons hidden powers when the arrive, yet

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:12.389
he’s just something else, Gabi in his eyes
possesses sheer talent.

00:14:12.389 --> 00:14:16.430
However, Gabimaru disagrees with his comment,
stating that everything that has happened

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:20.250
was because of everyone's efforts and the
sacrifices they made along the way for the

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.329
sole purpose of defeating Lord Tensen.

00:14:23.329 --> 00:14:27.589
While Ran is left shocked with Gabi’s pure
determination, Sagiri quickly frees Mei from

00:14:27.589 --> 00:14:30.970
the restraints and lets the others know they’re
gonna head for the elixir.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:34.640
Screaming at them to behave themselves, Ran
swings around and attempts to stop them but

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.880
is stopped himself by Gabimaru who yells at
the others to get it done.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:42.220
Still trying to get past, Ran quickly figures
that Gabi’s using his own Tao against him

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:46.550
and decides to suppress it, yet as soon as
he does, Yuzuriha comes in and slices the

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.959
plant man in two.

00:14:47.959 --> 00:14:52.310
Darting forth she goes to finish the job but
is warned by Gabimaru to stop.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:57.180
Ran, impressed with the skills of his enemies
decides that in light of the ritual, he is

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.480
not allowed to toy with them.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:03.759
His body suddenly begins turning into a bunch
of flowers and vines before exploding into

00:15:03.759 --> 00:15:08.509
his 4 armed Kishikai state.

00:15:08.509 --> 00:15:13.410
Rien sits in the ritual circle and reviews
the names of the human invaders given by Chōbei.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:17.600
With Zhu Jin encountering Shion and Nurugai,
Rien believes that he holds the advantage

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.850
since Shion's Wood Tao will have no effect
against Zhu Jin's Water Tao and Nurugai isn't

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.650
able to use hers yet.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:29.209
Still he does sense a great deal of rage and
knows that anger can greatly increase someone's

00:15:29.209 --> 00:15:30.209
abilities.

00:15:30.209 --> 00:15:34.980
Also at a similar time Gantetsusai and Fuchi
face Tao Fa and Ju Fa, Rien believes that

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:39.269
his team will defeat them with ease as neither
of their opponents have refined their Tao.

00:15:39.269 --> 00:15:43.620
Though he does takes note of Gabimaru as he
can sense that they need to be extremely careful

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.620
with him.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:49.389
After he finishes his review, Rien presents
the completed Elixir of Life to Jofuku and

00:15:49.389 --> 00:15:53.540
announces that once they defeat the human
invaders they will be ready to depart to the

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:56.130
mainland to continue with their ultimate plan.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:16:00.620
Meanwhile, the Asaemon from the second landing
party become exhausted after travelling so

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.459
far in such a short amount of time.

00:16:02.459 --> 00:16:06.440
After making it to the Tan pits all of them
are disgusted and disheartened once they find

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.029
what remains of Tenza and Genji.

00:16:09.029 --> 00:16:12.570
Furious at the fact that more of his close
friends have died before he was able to save

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:17.230
them, Shugen states that they make for Hōrai
now, once there, everyone, the hermits and

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:18.660
the convicts are to be eviscerated.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:23.540
Having stolen one of the special flutes the
Doshi use to control the Mōnshin, Shugen

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:28.529
blows it and commands them to carry him and
his crew to Hōrai at once.

00:16:28.529 --> 00:16:34.200
Remembering their past discussion on how if
the enemy evolves redirecting its Tao will

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:38.959
be impossible, Gabimaru comes up with the
idea of boosting Yuzuriha's Tao imbued weapons

00:16:38.959 --> 00:16:41.339
with his own to defeat Lord Tensen.

00:16:41.339 --> 00:16:45.420
Back in the fight, Gabi sees Ran going to
attack and prepares to use the same plan of

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:46.720
redirecting his Tao.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:51.500
However, he and Yuzuriha are completely dumbfounded
when a single punch from the immortals Kishikai

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:55.380
state blows apart the surroundings while also
knocking them back.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:17:00.269
Following up Ran pummels the life out of Yuzuriha
and Gabi, sending our boy shooting outside

00:17:00.269 --> 00:17:04.600
of the building and causing Yuzuriha to drop
to her knee’s severely injured.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.160
Elsewhere as Sagiri and Mei run throughout
the palace searching for the Laboratory, Mei

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:12.660
notices the loud noises coming from the Dō'in
Temple and become worried for their allies.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:17.370
Sagiri assures Mei that Gabimaru will be alright
since he has a backup plan but even still

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:21.079
the idea of him following through with that
plan worries her.

00:17:21.079 --> 00:17:25.100
Taking things up a level, the Kishikai monster
Knee’s causing massive damage before following

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.650
up and smashing him into the ground.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:31.679
Disappointed in how easily he’s being beaten,
Gabi takes note of how unlike the previous

00:17:31.679 --> 00:17:35.549
Kishikai’s they've seen, Ran’s mind is
still in control allowing him to perform his

00:17:35.549 --> 00:17:38.060
techniques to an even higher degree.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:41.660
Despite her past warnings that when push comes
to shove she’ll dip out of the fight, Yuzuriha

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:46.090
lets loose her rope like ability to grab her
teammate in an attempt to try and survive.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:49.720
However, Ran catches up to them and as she
realizes that if she doesn't block its the

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:53.110
end for her throws, Gabimaru manages to block
the attack on time.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:57.320
Having had enough with this pathetic cockroach
of a human, Ran throws away any idea of using

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:01.809
Gabimaru for Tan and instead smashes down
breaking his guard and seemingly ending our

00:18:01.809 --> 00:18:02.960
mans journey home.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:09.000
To top it off, Ran then throws Gabi into pillar,
leaving him their to live out his final moments...

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:13.290
Remembering all of the times Gabi had said
that his life takes priority and that he wouldn't

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:14.990
die until he makes it home.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:19.840
HE AGAIN REITERATES THAT THOUGHT, AS MAN ISNT
ABOUT TO END IT ALL.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:21.039
No no no no...

00:18:21.039 --> 00:18:26.679
Pricking his finger with one of the flowers
the young man chooses to to sacrifice whatever

00:18:26.679 --> 00:18:29.970
it takes in order to return to back to the
love of his life.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:34.950
Regaining his footing, Gabimaru stands back
up fully healed, while revealing his black

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:39.309
eye and the vine like patters that stretch
out over the left side of his face.

00:18:39.309 --> 00:18:43.460
So the reason that Gabimaru can achieve this
state and not just bloom into a bunch of flowers

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:46.850
like everyone else who’s been stung is for
a very specific few reasons.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:50.740
Pretty much if only a little bit of Tan makes
it into the body it has the possibility to

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:54.350
balance out, making someone the same as Tensen.

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:57.750
Gabimaru who had overheard this explanation
got everyone to accompany him to Mu Dan's

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:59.179
pile of bloomed flowers.

00:18:59.179 --> 00:19:03.020
He then retrieves one of his flower stingers
and plans to receive the same powers as Chōbei

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:08.040
by overcoming the Arborfication, but Mei objected
to doing it at that time due to just how dangerous

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.520
the risks are.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:13.480
However, Gabimaru reveals that he was already
aware of how Chōbei managed to accomplish

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.270
this feat and is willing to take the risk.

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.780
What separates Chōbei from everyone else
is that he has someone that he fights for

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.230
beside himself.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:24.940
So when he’s down on his luck he finds the
strength to defy death because no matter what

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.890
he’s gotta get back to his brother.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:33.570
Back with the girls, Sagiri becomes shocked
after only just learning about part 2 of his

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:37.980
plan, but knows that he is willing to do this
all in the hopes of returning back to this

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:38.980
wife.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:42.130
Over in the battle Gabimaru dodges out of
the way from a few thundering punches and

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.240
kicks.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.610
Focusing himself Gabi knows that he needs
to take out Ran before the flower takes over

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:50.840
his body, even still he notices that Ran’s
attacks are starting to become slower as he

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:53.280
consumes more Tao throughout the battle.

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:57.480
Yuzuriha whos still recovering from that previous
blast tells Gabi that he’s not normal, no

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:01.630
matter what happens, even if he dies he doesn't
stop pushing forward, all for the hope of

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:04.330
seeing someone that might not exist.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:08.720
Turning and looking at her Gabimaru explains
that yeah he may be crazy, but there’s only

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.340
some places idiots can truly reach.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:15.770
Someone who keeps a cool head and thinks logically
just wont survive, there’s times were you’ve

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.200
just got to let loose.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:21.370
He compliments Yuzuriha as someone who pushes
people away on the off chance that they might

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.169
make her an idiot.

00:20:23.169 --> 00:20:27.280
Hearing this, she becomes encouraged by Gabi
to step forth despite her wounds and fight

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:30.289
with her friend in a dance of death.

00:20:30.289 --> 00:20:34.530
Knowing that his Fire Tao has no effect on
Ran's Water, Gabimaru tells Yuzuriha that

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:37.320
they need to rely on her Earth affinity to
defeat him.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:42.000
Needing to make an opening for her, Gabi starts
off by activating his ascetic form and using

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.730
Ninpo: Demonic Firebug to throw a burst of
fire at Ran.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:49.590
The immortal easily extinguishes the flames
but Gabi slides in next to him and activates

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:54.080
Ninpo: Burning Bridge sending a fireball rocketing
towards Rans face.

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:58.110
Slashing his foot back, Ran comfortably dissipates
the flames from around him, yet as he does

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:02.340
so Yuzuriha makes her move and latches onto
him down with her mucus strings.

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:05.740
Thinking thats good enough to finish him off,
Gabimaru attacks and dodges an attack Ran

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:06.950
makes to his tanden.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:11.410
He then uses Ninpo: Ascetic Blaze in an attempt
to scorch the creature but as he looks down

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:15.550
at his work, see’s a hand reach through
and toss him towards Yuzuriha.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:19.570
Slightly impressed Ran says that even with
this scheme of theirs its only a futile struggle

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:23.299
thats prolonging the inevitable and yet its
beautiful to behold.

00:21:23.299 --> 00:21:27.481
Hearing Gabi talk some smack, Ran prepares
himself for the final bout and tells them

00:21:27.481 --> 00:21:29.340
to show him everything they have.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:40.550
Okay yeah im not gonna hit ya with 30 seconds
of techniques so re-igniting the battle, the

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:45.309
two shinobi then unleash their various ninjutsu
techniques in combination with each other.

00:21:45.309 --> 00:21:49.559
Ran somehow manages to block every ability
and bushes them off but suddenly notices that

00:21:49.559 --> 00:21:51.540
his body started to crack.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:55.590
With the immortal randomly confused with what
just happened, Gabimaru reveals that his earlier

00:21:55.590 --> 00:22:00.410
attack was meant to overstimulate Ran in order
to make him lose his sense of judgement and

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:01.410
timing.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:06.870
Throughout the fight they were able to stall
for enough time to have the Kishikai use up

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:08.470
all of its Tao.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:13.539
Suddenly Ran's Kishikai form explodes, revealing
his weakened and reforming state, giving Gabimaru

00:22:13.539 --> 00:22:15.980
and Yuzuriha an opening to attack.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:20.570
As the two rush in, Yuzuriha starts to feel
pain coming from her wound but tries to endure

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:22.400
it until they defeat Ran.

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:26.110
Rising back up infront of them, Gabimaru sees
that Ran had managed to cancel out his form

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:27.970
before completely running out of Tao.

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:31.940
While changing genders Ran swipes at Gabi,
making it obvious to the Ninja that he’s

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:35.309
trying to recover his lost Tao by cycling
between yin and yang.

00:22:35.309 --> 00:22:39.870
He screams out to Yuzuriha to use her ability
before he recovers and hearing this, Ran reaches

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:43.670
out clutching down on Gabi’s shoulder telling
him that its impossible.

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:47.370
He knows that the wound she received earlier
is extremely deep and should she continue

00:22:47.370 --> 00:22:49.600
with the plan, she will die...

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:54.770
Stopping in her tracks Yuzuriha agrees with
Ran's statement and throws her Kunai away.

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:58.909
Suddenly spinning around though, the QUEEN
catches her weapon and sparks up her Tao as

00:22:58.909 --> 00:23:02.580
its time to follow through with what she came
here to do.

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:05.860
Slapping his hands together, the immortal
goes on the defense by forming a field of

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:09.630
massive spikes in an attempt to take Yuzuriha
down before she reaches him.

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:13.610
Putting out his hand, Gabi helps Yuzuriha
avoid the spikes by flicking her up into the

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:14.610
air.

00:23:14.610 --> 00:23:18.110
She then jumps down off the ceiling and as
she perceives the remaining Tao inside of

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:22.420
Ran’s Tanden, annihilates it with the Earth
affinity infused kunai.

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:27.351
With the battle coming to and end, the immortal
being then starts to crumble away, calling

00:23:27.351 --> 00:23:38.220
out for his brother during his pitiful demise.

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:48.200
After he fully turned into a bunch of foliage,
Yuzuriha warns Gabimaru about the Arborfication

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:50.950
process eventually taking over his body.

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:55.070
Still in his eyes he knew that he had no other
option if he wanted to see his wife again.

00:23:55.070 --> 00:24:00.390
He then suggests that they catch up to Sagiri
and Mei but Yuzuriha needing to rest tells

00:24:00.390 --> 00:24:02.360
him to leave without her.

00:24:02.360 --> 00:24:06.380
Before leaving, Gabimaru tells Yuzuriha that
he’ll be waiting for her at the boats and

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:10.270
also thanks once again for saving his life
when they first encountered each other on

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:11.419
the island.

00:24:11.419 --> 00:24:15.650
AHHH man this moment always gets my freaking
tear ducts rolling.

00:24:15.650 --> 00:24:20.020
After being left alone, Yuzuriha unbuttons
her dress and removes the mucus protecting

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:22.250
the would she received.

00:24:22.250 --> 00:24:26.190
Thinking to herself, she finds its sad that
she never showed her heart to anyone, till

00:24:26.190 --> 00:24:32.120
the end she remained the same, always going
at it alone whether that be life or death...

00:24:32.120 --> 00:24:37.279
Knowing that her life was at risk, Yuzuriha
apologizes to her deceased sister Saya.

00:24:37.279 --> 00:24:43.120
She really really tried to live for the both
of them, but this here is the end of her road.

00:24:43.120 --> 00:24:47.350
Remembering what she said to Senta when he
passed, she tells herself those same words.

00:24:47.350 --> 00:24:51.090
“When it hurts go ahead and think about
whatever you want.

00:24:51.090 --> 00:24:52.810
A pet cat, maybe?

00:24:52.810 --> 00:24:54.530
A lover left behind?

00:24:54.530 --> 00:24:55.530
Your family?

00:24:55.530 --> 00:24:58.360
Pass on with that beautiful vision.

00:24:58.360 --> 00:25:04.200
Yuzuriha then faints with a smile on her face
after thinking about Saya as her final thoughts.

00:25:04.200 --> 00:25:08.360
(Damn that hurts every time, sorry I had to
blur some stuff and have been throughout the

00:25:08.360 --> 00:25:12.620
video cause Yuki is crazy.

00:25:12.620 --> 00:25:17.309
But yeah that really hurts my soul, I don't
know what false expectation id brought on

00:25:17.309 --> 00:25:19.309
myself at this point.

00:25:19.309 --> 00:25:23.809
Like I just thought everyone was gonna be
okay)

00:25:23.809 --> 00:25:27.930
Nearby while Gabimaru runs, he remembers the
plan that they need at least five people of

00:25:27.930 --> 00:25:31.929
their group to help sail one of the underground
ships and goes to push forth to the temple.

00:25:31.929 --> 00:25:36.070
However, he stops still dropping to the ground
as the effects of the vines spread through

00:25:36.070 --> 00:25:37.240
his body.

00:25:37.240 --> 00:25:41.240
Beginning to crawl he remembers Yuzuriha’s
words on how the more he regenerates, the

00:25:41.240 --> 00:25:43.580
quicker the vines will take hold.

00:25:43.580 --> 00:25:47.630
Thinking of his and the look she’d have
on her face if she saw him now, he fully collapses

00:25:47.630 --> 00:25:50.110
before losing consciousness.

00:25:50.110 --> 00:25:58.539
Moments earlier in the Bōchū Jutsu sanctum,
Gantetsusai, Fuchi, and Tōma encounter Ju

00:25:58.539 --> 00:26:01.529
Fa, Tao Fa, and Chōbei.

00:26:01.529 --> 00:26:06.620
Seeing his brother, Chōbei puts out his hand
and informs Tōma that Lord Tensen has agreed

00:26:06.620 --> 00:26:11.450
to make them immortal, all he has to do now
is join him.

00:26:11.450 --> 00:26:16.130
Big G tells Tōma to leave and rejoin his
brother as he doesn't think that them gaining

00:26:16.130 --> 00:26:18.760
one more wimp is gonna even the odd.

00:26:18.760 --> 00:26:24.870
After saying goodbye, Tōma walks up the stairs
to finally see his brother for the first time

00:26:24.870 --> 00:26:26.429
in days.

00:26:26.429 --> 00:26:30.659
INSTANTLY as the BOYS see each other they
break out into a gleeful smile and slash at

00:26:30.659 --> 00:26:32.700
the two immortals standing next to them.

00:26:32.700 --> 00:26:36.120
The creatures try to retaliate, but the boys
are able to overcome the monsters and send

00:26:36.120 --> 00:26:37.910
them tumbling down the stairs.

00:26:37.910 --> 00:26:41.549
Proudly standing there, Chōbei tells his
bro that he was slow on the uptake but can

00:26:41.549 --> 00:26:48.820
already sense that he’s come into his own.

00:26:48.820 --> 00:27:01.470
With 
a fat smile on his face he thanks both Gantetsusai

00:27:01.470 --> 00:27:05.390
and Fuchi for keeping his brother safe and
shows his gratitude by having them take on

00:27:05.390 --> 00:27:09.360
Tao Fa, while they take on the other immortal.

00:27:09.360 --> 00:27:13.270
Gantetsusai and Fuchi then watch in shock
as Tao Fa regenerates from the previous attack

00:27:13.270 --> 00:27:16.399
and expresses her disappointment in Chōbei's
betrayal.

00:27:16.399 --> 00:27:20.940
Getting her attention Gantetsusai points his
blade towards her and asks if she wanted him

00:27:20.940 --> 00:27:22.429
to take the pain away.

00:27:22.429 --> 00:27:27.289
Over the other side of the room, the bro’s
then prepare to fight Ju Fa, who after recovering

00:27:27.289 --> 00:27:30.990
becomes enraged at the fact the attacked Tao
Fa.

00:27:30.990 --> 00:27:34.940
Let the rematch begin.

00:27:34.940 --> 00:27:38.640
Just like last time Ju Fa believes that nothing
is going to change no matter how much they

00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:39.640
try.

00:27:39.640 --> 00:27:43.679
Dashing in, the brothers lay down a plethora
of strikes that the immortal manages to fend

00:27:43.679 --> 00:27:44.679
off.

00:27:44.679 --> 00:27:47.890
Dropping down to the floor, Tōma jumps off
Chōbei’s back and manages to land an attack

00:27:47.890 --> 00:27:49.090
on Ju Fa.

00:27:49.090 --> 00:27:53.030
However he uses this to catch Tōma off guard
and almost hits him with a volley of Tao energy

00:27:53.030 --> 00:27:54.049
balls.

00:27:54.049 --> 00:27:57.700
Having been pulled to the side in time by
his brother, the two then re-engage in a close

00:27:57.700 --> 00:28:01.500
combat duel, slashing at the immortal and
slowly beginning to push him back.

00:28:01.500 --> 00:28:05.620
Unable to stop the force from pushing im back,
Tōma darts in close and manages to deal a

00:28:05.620 --> 00:28:10.010
significant strike to the monsters face, making
it realize that this battle is the complete

00:28:10.010 --> 00:28:11.669
opposite to last time.

00:28:11.669 --> 00:28:15.340
Just like in the battle with Ran, he then
angrily decides to ignore the ritual and take

00:28:15.340 --> 00:28:17.090
out the two brothers.

00:28:17.090 --> 00:28:21.930
Meanwhile on the first floor, Gantetsusai
explodes after seeing just how beautiful Tao

00:28:21.930 --> 00:28:23.080
Fa is after losing some of her clothing.

00:28:23.080 --> 00:28:26.700
After taking a complement from Fuchi, she
dashes at Gantetsusai and attacks him with

00:28:26.700 --> 00:28:30.630
a strong punch, before following up and kicking
him in the head sending him crashing towards

00:28:30.630 --> 00:28:31.630
a pillar.

00:28:31.630 --> 00:28:35.460
She jokes that hearing some old creep gawk
over here makes the skin on her body crawl.

00:28:35.460 --> 00:28:39.520
(even though she’s literally a 1000 years
old, anyway anyway) Calling Fuchi cute though

00:28:39.520 --> 00:28:42.880
she offers to partake in a round of Bōchū
Jutsu with her.

00:28:42.880 --> 00:28:47.830
AEEEE MY BROTHER However, Fuchi cuts her off
literally and declines, stating that he’s

00:28:47.830 --> 00:28:51.520
only interested in examining the construction
of her biology.

00:28:51.520 --> 00:28:56.000
Picking himself back up, Big G becomes excited
with the idea of spending some quality time

00:28:56.000 --> 00:28:57.640
with Tao Fa.

00:28:57.640 --> 00:29:01.669
Wanting to get down to business and continue
with the rite of just consumption, Tao Fa

00:29:01.669 --> 00:29:02.679
bulks up.

00:29:02.679 --> 00:29:06.740
The boys dart in and slash at her, but the
immortal easily takes control over the battle

00:29:06.740 --> 00:29:08.830
comfortably dodging all of their strikes.

00:29:08.830 --> 00:29:13.200
Jumping up Tao Fa lets loose a wave of Tao
that pushes out from all around her, flinging

00:29:13.200 --> 00:29:14.440
our guys across the room.

00:29:14.440 --> 00:29:19.090
Seeing as they cannot defeat her by normal
means, Fuchi suggests that they formulate

00:29:19.090 --> 00:29:22.580
a strategy to fight against her ability to
use Tao.

00:29:22.580 --> 00:29:27.160
However, Gantetsusai screams frustrated with
the notion of Tao, having heard the word a

00:29:27.160 --> 00:29:30.919
million times isn't gonna change anything
in his eyes, plus he cant even remember half

00:29:30.919 --> 00:29:33.190
the stuff that goes into it.

00:29:33.190 --> 00:29:38.169
Instead he just wants to have fun, he runs
at the immortal trying his best to take her

00:29:38.169 --> 00:29:41.010
out while she simultaneously mocks him for
not being able to use Tao.

00:29:41.010 --> 00:29:46.080
She shows him the advantage to using Tao,
kicking him in the back while she stood behind

00:29:46.080 --> 00:29:47.080
him.

00:29:47.080 --> 00:29:50.220
Floating up Tao Fa lands just a simple tap
to Gantetsusai’s face, but the resulting

00:29:50.220 --> 00:29:55.630
blast sends forth a flurry of Tao kicks that
leave him on the ground.

00:29:55.630 --> 00:30:01.090
Dancing around him, relentlessly mocking him
she just tells him to give up, however Gantetsusai

00:30:01.090 --> 00:30:05.320
refuses and comments on how she must've had
fun toying with humans for the past 1,000

00:30:05.320 --> 00:30:06.320
years.

00:30:06.320 --> 00:30:10.409
After hearing this statement, Tao Fa loses
her smile and expresses that all of this time

00:30:10.409 --> 00:30:15.291
they’ve trained to achieve immortality,
they lure humans over and over and over again

00:30:15.291 --> 00:30:16.899
for a thousand yes.

00:30:16.899 --> 00:30:21.430
Yet still, even now they haven't been able
to achieve perfect immortal bodies.

00:30:21.430 --> 00:30:25.580
They’ve all realized it, its just that if
she stops smiling now, she’ll completely

00:30:25.580 --> 00:30:29.080
lose her mind or maybe she already has.

00:30:29.080 --> 00:30:33.130
She then attacks the two with another blast
of Tao and disagrees with Gantetsusai's statement

00:30:33.130 --> 00:30:36.110
saying that the whole process isn't fun at
all.

00:30:36.110 --> 00:30:40.190
Having properly experienced Tao for the fist
time, Fuchi picks himself up and imagines

00:30:40.190 --> 00:30:43.470
the breakthroughs he can make to medical science
with this knowledge he just gained.

00:30:43.470 --> 00:30:48.429
Also feeling a little different Gantetsusai
stands up excited to continue with the battle.

00:30:48.429 --> 00:30:52.059
Initially confused, Tao Fa is astonished by
there enemies ambitions that causes them to

00:30:52.059 --> 00:30:55.810
continue fighting and senses their Tao surging
around them.

00:30:55.810 --> 00:31:00.090
Sprinting at the immortal now, Tao Fa launches
another invisible projectile towards Gantetsusai.

00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:04.102
However, he briefly senses her the attack
and dodges, shocking the immortal who then

00:31:04.102 --> 00:31:05.300
receives a fatal blow.

00:31:05.300 --> 00:31:11.389
So back before they all left for the palace,
Shion explained to Nurugai, Fuchi, and Gantetsusai

00:31:11.389 --> 00:31:15.690
that they were unable to sense Tao because
they depend to much on their eyes in battle.

00:31:15.690 --> 00:31:21.330
To use Tao, one must detach themselves from
reality and all the body to embrace the sensation.

00:31:21.330 --> 00:31:26.799
Laying there not participating in learning,
Gantetsusai explains he only believes in things

00:31:26.799 --> 00:31:31.260
that he can cut while Fuchi explains that
he can only accept things that he can touch.

00:31:31.260 --> 00:31:35.600
In the present day, after managing to land
his first attack on Tao Fa, Gantetsusai figures

00:31:35.600 --> 00:31:39.430
that he can use this weird technique, only
for the Tensen to instantly retaliate sending

00:31:39.430 --> 00:31:43.540
him shooting into a pillar saying that it
was probably just luck.

00:31:43.540 --> 00:31:47.830
Fuchi comes in from behind and manages to
push her away from Gantetsusai as he recovers,

00:31:47.830 --> 00:31:52.250
however, she suddenly appears right infront
of him and hits him with a point blank attack

00:31:52.250 --> 00:31:56.000
before grabbing him by the neck and blasting
him with another flurry of energy balls.

00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:59.740
Tao Fa drops Fuchi allowing him to get back
while she comments on how sweet the lengths

00:31:59.740 --> 00:32:02.620
he was willing to go to in order to help his
"friend".

00:32:02.620 --> 00:32:07.590
Battered and bruised, Fuchi says that Gantetsusai
wasn't his friend, yet in that moment he falls

00:32:07.590 --> 00:32:12.380
into a memory where he told big G they weren't
friends, but they also weren't so different

00:32:12.380 --> 00:32:13.510
from each other.

00:32:13.510 --> 00:32:18.130
This didnt apply to just him aswell, all of
the executioners at the end of the day are

00:32:18.130 --> 00:32:22.470
just human and if they make connections with
someone it leads to genuine feelings just

00:32:22.470 --> 00:32:23.470
like anyone else.

00:32:23.470 --> 00:32:27.090
In the short time they’ve spent together
he was able to observe that the samurai were

00:32:27.090 --> 00:32:31.350
no different from the convicts, everyone is
made of skin and bone with an innate desire

00:32:31.350 --> 00:32:32.529
to live.

00:32:32.529 --> 00:32:36.380
From the bottom of his little heart Fuchi
wished that Gantetsusai along with everyone

00:32:36.380 --> 00:32:41.440
else would return home safely, even if they
never spoke again after that day.

00:32:41.440 --> 00:32:44.720
Watching the little man infront of him just
standing there, Gantetsusai senses that he’s

00:32:44.720 --> 00:32:49.010
in massive danger AND LIKE THE MADLAD he is
rips out his eye.

00:32:49.010 --> 00:32:54.000
Back just before when he dodged that blast
he knew that he was relying on sensation and

00:32:54.000 --> 00:32:55.330
NOT SIGHT.

00:32:55.330 --> 00:32:59.179
Now though, mans on a completely different
level and can perceive everything around him

00:32:59.179 --> 00:33:00.870
through the use of Tao.

00:33:00.870 --> 00:33:04.320
He quickly grabs Fuchi and dives out of the
way before another volley of energy balls

00:33:04.320 --> 00:33:05.710
could take them out.

00:33:05.710 --> 00:33:10.440
Stepping back into the frey, Gantetsusai screams
that every attack she hits him with only increases

00:33:10.440 --> 00:33:14.220
his strength and now he’s eager to let loose.

00:33:14.220 --> 00:33:19.360
Flashing back into the past after our man
big Gantetsusai was defeated by his former

00:33:19.360 --> 00:33:20.360
master.

00:33:20.360 --> 00:33:25.830
Turns out our big mans actual name is Tetsunosuke,
sitting there he wonders how his master was

00:33:25.830 --> 00:33:28.880
able to defeat him despite being an old cripple.

00:33:28.880 --> 00:33:32.741
Knowing that his pupil wants to learn more,
his master explains to the young man that

00:33:32.741 --> 00:33:36.330
he has become greedy with wanting to become
stronger and tells him that he must let go

00:33:36.330 --> 00:33:42.299
of his strength, then let go of it some more
and he’ll finally find everything he wants.

00:33:42.299 --> 00:33:46.000
Thinking on that statement some more, Gantetsusai
re-iterates that he didnt have a clue what

00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:47.720
his master meant back then.

00:33:47.720 --> 00:33:53.029
Yet now after a life of mistakes he finally
gets it, the more you gain, the harder it

00:33:53.029 --> 00:33:56.659
gets to take a good look at yourself.

00:33:56.659 --> 00:34:00.889
In the present, Gantetsusai manages to dodge
Tao Fa's projectiles and continuously strikes

00:34:00.889 --> 00:34:03.650
away at he, not giving her a chance to regenerate.

00:34:03.650 --> 00:34:07.730
However, his attacks are unable to stop her
from reviving as sadly Gantetsusai doesn't

00:34:07.730 --> 00:34:10.480
have the right attribute to properly take
her down.

00:34:10.480 --> 00:34:14.149
Not wanting the battle to turn into one of
attrition, Fuchi knows that only his Metal

00:34:14.149 --> 00:34:19.020
Tao will be able to stop Tao Fa from regenerating
and jumps in to grab her so that it subsequently

00:34:19.020 --> 00:34:22.380
weakens the immortal allowing Gantetsusai
to cut her tanden.

00:34:22.380 --> 00:34:27.369
With time beginning to slow as big G swings
his blade towards their foe, he asks himself

00:34:27.369 --> 00:34:30.530
if he should just trust this new sensation.

00:34:30.530 --> 00:34:35.290
Remembering his master’s words to stare
good and hard at what's left, as in their

00:34:35.290 --> 00:34:40.300
he’ll find everything, Gantetsusai closes
his eyes and uses a Tao infused strike to

00:34:40.300 --> 00:34:46.780
precisely cut the immortals tanden without
harming Fuchi who continued holding her from

00:34:46.780 --> 00:34:47.780
behind.

00:34:47.780 --> 00:34:52.700
Meanwhile, Chōbei over in his own battle
prepares to unleash his transformation on

00:34:52.700 --> 00:34:56.829
Ju Fa to increase his abilities but is stopped
by Tōma who believes that they can defeat

00:34:56.829 --> 00:34:58.160
him together.

00:34:58.160 --> 00:35:01.180
The immortal feign tells them that they are
foolish for thinking that they stand a chance

00:35:01.180 --> 00:35:05.630
against him and his sister, to which Chōbei
explains that no matter where, what or who

00:35:05.630 --> 00:35:09.840
they are he always crushes his opponents with
his bro covering his sides.

00:35:09.840 --> 00:35:14.050
Becoming enraged that the pathetic livestock
wont just end this futile battle The Tensen

00:35:14.050 --> 00:35:18.010
tells them that the only thing they have in
common is the fact that they fight better

00:35:18.010 --> 00:35:19.010
in pairs.

00:35:19.010 --> 00:35:22.240
Reaching out his right hand, another suddenly
reaches through the opening in the curtain

00:35:22.240 --> 00:35:23.240
next to him.

00:35:23.240 --> 00:35:27.610
Down below its shown that the body of Tao
Fa had begun to bloom into a tree like state

00:35:27.610 --> 00:35:31.130
with fruit growing from each of the limb like
branches.

00:35:31.130 --> 00:35:35.180
Apologizing to his girl, Ju Fa then begins
fusing with the other Tensen, while stating

00:35:35.180 --> 00:35:38.550
that together they will obliterate them.

00:35:38.550 --> 00:35:42.730
As a child, Ju Fa and Tao Fa were told that
they were special, in that they were born

00:35:42.730 --> 00:35:44.760
as two parts of a whole.

00:35:44.760 --> 00:35:49.270
Since then, Ju Fa developed the urge to protect
Tao Fa and always came to Mei for answers.

00:35:49.270 --> 00:35:53.420
In one specific memory of his, Mei tells him
that it was natural for him to care for her

00:35:53.420 --> 00:35:57.829
since they were partners, the fact that he
is able to imagine the pain she feels is perfect

00:35:57.829 --> 00:35:58.970
proof of that!

00:35:58.970 --> 00:36:02.640
Empathy is both the root of uneasiness and
compassion.

00:36:02.640 --> 00:36:06.790
Yet because of what they are, its inherently
harder for them to understand or internalize

00:36:06.790 --> 00:36:08.640
these thoughts.

00:36:08.640 --> 00:36:12.890
Sadly though a change soon started showing
itself in Rien after he introduces the five

00:36:12.890 --> 00:36:16.690
Tensen's to the Hōko, explaining that they
are allowed to use them to replenish their

00:36:16.690 --> 00:36:17.690
Tao.

00:36:17.690 --> 00:36:21.470
He then assigns them their true training art
in an attempt to help them achieve immortality.

00:36:21.470 --> 00:36:26.520
Both of them were in my eyes disgustingly
assigned with Bochu Jutsu, like common man

00:36:26.520 --> 00:36:29.080
they were pretty much family at this point.

00:36:29.080 --> 00:36:34.310
During one of their I guess i've gotta call
it a training session, Tao Fa expresses her

00:36:34.310 --> 00:36:36.410
pity in using the Hōko to replenish their
Tao.

00:36:36.410 --> 00:36:41.570
Ju Fa agrees with her which in turn causes
Tao Fa to feel happy that he understands exactly

00:36:41.570 --> 00:36:43.190
how she feels.

00:36:43.190 --> 00:36:47.270
After a few centuries had passed, Ju Fa becomes
frustrated that the Hōko are on the verge

00:36:47.270 --> 00:36:51.560
of extinction due to their Arborfication and
how Rien and Jofuku are not trying to fix

00:36:51.560 --> 00:36:52.560
the problem.

00:36:52.560 --> 00:36:56.730
Gui Fa which is one of the Tensen I haven't
mentioned before, suggests using the humans

00:36:56.730 --> 00:36:58.770
from the mainland as another source.

00:36:58.770 --> 00:37:02.640
Which just like Mu Dan says, if they don't
do exactly that then its likely they’ll

00:37:02.640 --> 00:37:05.660
deplete their Tao over time and die.

00:37:05.660 --> 00:37:09.540
After remembering everything that Tao Fa has
gone through, Ju Fa becomes angry and slams

00:37:09.540 --> 00:37:13.099
the table screaming that everything they’ve
been through has been for nothing.

00:37:13.099 --> 00:37:16.930
Looking up he suddenly starts to watch as
the Tensen's faces turn into smiling pits

00:37:16.930 --> 00:37:17.930
of darkness.

00:37:17.930 --> 00:37:22.120
Fearing what they’ve become he starts to
question if they’re all mad, did the endless

00:37:22.120 --> 00:37:24.400
training drive them to insanity?

00:37:24.400 --> 00:37:28.119
Feeling broken inside he just ponders the
thought that maybe its him and Tao Fa that’re

00:37:28.119 --> 00:37:29.730
the crazy ones.

00:37:29.730 --> 00:37:33.960
Later, he walks down to the floodgate and
sees that Mu Dan and Tao Fa are preparing

00:37:33.960 --> 00:37:37.050
to send out an Arborified Hōko to lure in
humans to the island.

00:37:37.050 --> 00:37:41.760
Ju Fa asks his girl if she was okay with doing
this, as after all she had in the past stated

00:37:41.760 --> 00:37:43.869
that she didnt like treating the Hoko this
way.

00:37:43.869 --> 00:37:49.480
Turning around with a beautiful open smile
on her face she confirms, answering with yes

00:37:49.480 --> 00:37:51.630
while asking if this was crazy of her.

00:37:51.630 --> 00:37:56.760
Kneeling down next to her, Ju Fa puts his
arm around Tao Fa and tells her that she wasn't

00:37:56.760 --> 00:37:57.760
crazy.

00:37:57.760 --> 00:38:02.079
The humans are like the Hoko, lower than the
livestock and fit for their use.

00:38:02.079 --> 00:38:07.070
Thinking if he’s indeed crazy, he pushes
it to the side stating, instead its the world

00:38:07.070 --> 00:38:09.190
around them thats gone mad.

00:38:09.190 --> 00:38:13.319
Sadly back in the present with the two finally
becoming one and transforming into their Kishikai

00:38:13.319 --> 00:38:18.030
states, they look down with their own crazy
transformation telling the pathetic humans

00:38:18.030 --> 00:38:19.990
that they’re nothing more than livestock.

00:38:19.990 --> 00:38:26.650
Daaaaamn I always feel so bad fo Ju Fa man
just wanted his girl to be happy, so he’s

00:38:26.650 --> 00:38:29.510
followed her till the ends of the earth.

00:38:29.510 --> 00:38:31.349
Absolute respect!

00:38:31.349 --> 00:38:32.349
Anyways

00:38:32.349 --> 00:38:36.320
Having fused together into their destructive
embodiment of love, the duo emit and ear piercing

00:38:36.320 --> 00:38:40.630
screech causing Chōbei, Tōma, Gantetsusai
and Fuchi’s to immediately protect their

00:38:40.630 --> 00:38:41.630
ears.

00:38:41.630 --> 00:38:44.910
Chōbei throws his sword to attack but misses
as the monster flies up breaking through the

00:38:44.910 --> 00:38:49.450
ceiling of the palace before ominously floating
above them in the nights sky.

00:38:49.450 --> 00:38:53.720
Confused Fuchi begins to wonder how the monster
is able to fly with an unnatural proportion,

00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:58.140
however the way it captivates his thoughts
makes him feel as though its the embodiment

00:38:58.140 --> 00:38:59.630
of love itself.

00:38:59.630 --> 00:39:04.359
Gantetsusai mocks Chōbei's earlier attack
causing our bandit king to claim that he’ll

00:39:04.359 --> 00:39:06.640
fight big g next after defeating the monster.

00:39:06.640 --> 00:39:10.760
Fuchi tells Gantetsusai that he needed to
administer first aid before he could fight

00:39:10.760 --> 00:39:16.450
again, however, he refuses and says that his
only focus is on defeating the immortals.

00:39:16.450 --> 00:39:21.190
Looking at his friend though, Fuchi watches
as Gantetsusai starts to laugh uncontrollably.

00:39:21.190 --> 00:39:24.880
Quickly realizing what's causing it, he sees
that one of the spores the monster had sneakily

00:39:24.880 --> 00:39:27.540
let loose managed to sink into Gantetsusai's
neck.

00:39:27.540 --> 00:39:31.950
Having managed to not get hit himself, he
removes the barb and tells the other that

00:39:31.950 --> 00:39:33.130
they need to get under cover.

00:39:33.130 --> 00:39:37.740
Chōbei knowing that he needs to break this
stalemate prepares to jump up and fight the

00:39:37.740 --> 00:39:38.740
monster.

00:39:38.740 --> 00:39:42.560
He transforms and sends forth a couple of
vines that allow him to get ahold of the immortal.

00:39:42.560 --> 00:39:46.820
Hanging there he then morphs his hand into
a massive battle axe and cuts Tao Fa's tanden

00:39:46.820 --> 00:39:51.450
with his vines, making him realize that his
Metal affinity dominates one of the immortals

00:39:51.450 --> 00:39:52.450
wood.

00:39:52.450 --> 00:39:55.980
Randomly splitting itself inhalf, the immortal
then sends a lightning fast barrage towards

00:39:55.980 --> 00:39:58.770
Chōbei, which connects and manages to skewer
him.

00:39:58.770 --> 00:40:02.770
Then picking it up a notch, the creature boosts
itself forwards before using that momentum

00:40:02.770 --> 00:40:07.220
to send Chōbei flying across the area and
back through a building.

00:40:07.220 --> 00:40:10.520
Gantetsusai mocks Chōbei once again while
next to him Tōma panics thinking that her

00:40:10.520 --> 00:40:12.160
brother is in danger.

00:40:12.160 --> 00:40:15.951
Fuchi calms them down and says that there
is no way they could slash the monster in

00:40:15.951 --> 00:40:19.930
one slice so in order to defeat it they have
to work together.

00:40:19.930 --> 00:40:24.180
Big G and the Bandit king exchange some half
assed insults about working with each other,

00:40:24.180 --> 00:40:27.650
yet as soon as the creature tries to attack
them, they turn their anger towards it and

00:40:27.650 --> 00:40:28.650
deflect its attack.

00:40:28.650 --> 00:40:32.940
Fuchi like the calm headed G he is, kinda
just realized Fuchi literally replaced Senta

00:40:32.940 --> 00:40:37.839
as a character with his entirety, except unlike
Senta he isn't afraid to inflict injury.

00:40:37.839 --> 00:40:43.290
Oh well he reminds them that their enemy is
the Kishikai amalgamation in front of them

00:40:43.290 --> 00:40:47.200
and that they can focus on fighting each other
later.

00:40:47.200 --> 00:40:51.760
Finally stepping forth with everyone now planning
to work together Chōbei, Tōma, Gantetsusai

00:40:51.760 --> 00:40:54.210
and Fuchi all vow to win.

00:40:54.210 --> 00:40:57.780
With all of the others standing behind him
Chōbei transforms and blocks the monsters

00:40:57.780 --> 00:40:58.780
vine attack.

00:40:58.780 --> 00:41:02.560
Growing some more branches, the immortal shoots
some stingers towards the group, but the bandit

00:41:02.560 --> 00:41:05.520
throws himself infront of them to save his
bro from being hit.

00:41:05.520 --> 00:41:09.710
While stuck dazed wondering if he can even
handle this foe, Chōbei reviews the elemental

00:41:09.710 --> 00:41:13.890
attribute cycle and knows that because of
the secret technique he has in store hes the

00:41:13.890 --> 00:41:16.319
only who can actually finish the immortals.

00:41:16.319 --> 00:41:20.880
Ju Fa sprouts an extra vine to attack Chōbei
but suddenly its sliced in half by Tōma.

00:41:20.880 --> 00:41:24.990
He then grabs Fuchi's hand in order to strengthen
his Metal Tao and darts forth with him to

00:41:24.990 --> 00:41:26.160
slice Tao Fa's tanden.

00:41:26.160 --> 00:41:30.530
Getting in close, Tōma uses Fuchi’s momentum
and flings him in close enough so that he’s

00:41:30.530 --> 00:41:32.589
able to land a slice on the Tanden.

00:41:32.589 --> 00:41:36.839
Sensing an opportunity, Gantetsusai jumps
in to deliver his attack but accidentally

00:41:36.839 --> 00:41:41.960
slips and falls into the pool as the monster
itself once again flies up into the sky.

00:41:41.960 --> 00:41:46.270
Standing there Chōbei sees Tōma arguing
with Gantetsusai and remembers how throughout

00:41:46.270 --> 00:41:49.470
there lives, he’s never seen this side of
him.

00:41:49.470 --> 00:41:53.470
Throughout their childhood he was always someone
who could only ever follow in someone's footsteps,

00:41:53.470 --> 00:41:58.730
but now hes noticed that his brother has slowly
started to become his own person.

00:41:58.730 --> 00:42:02.890
Realizing they should probably be focusing
on the battle, Chōbei points everyone's attention

00:42:02.890 --> 00:42:06.760
up to the newly evolved monster still floating
in the sky.

00:42:06.760 --> 00:42:09.570
Knowing that they can't defeat the monster
without destroying both tandens simultaneously,

00:42:09.570 --> 00:42:14.530
Chōbei assigns himself with Gantetsusai in
order kill Ju Fa with strategy he has planned,

00:42:14.530 --> 00:42:18.329
while the leftovers; Tōma and Fuchi deal
with Tao Fa.

00:42:18.329 --> 00:42:24.050
Reverting back to Simpoma he asks his brother
what he should do, Chōbei though punches

00:42:24.050 --> 00:42:29.690
him on the head demanding that he make his
own decisions now, since he has faith in his

00:42:29.690 --> 00:42:30.690
abilities.

00:42:30.690 --> 00:42:34.010
Gantetsusai isn't exactly chill about teaming
up with Chōbei and is initially reluctant

00:42:34.010 --> 00:42:38.410
to listen to his orders but after the bandit
complements his strength man gets straight

00:42:38.410 --> 00:42:40.020
up manipulated into fighting with him.

00:42:40.020 --> 00:42:44.230
Chōbei looks towards the monster and notes
that they are similar for the fact that both

00:42:44.230 --> 00:42:46.380
duo’s are willing to protect their own.

00:42:46.380 --> 00:42:50.250
In his eyes though, Tōma has grown to the
point where he no longer needs protection

00:42:50.250 --> 00:42:59.859
and because of that states that he will rip
them both a part so they can pass on together.

00:42:59.859 --> 00:43:03.349
Skipping back to before the battle begun,
we see that Rien while setting up the ritual

00:43:03.349 --> 00:43:07.380
of rite consumption told Chōbei that his
brother bears an ill omen.

00:43:07.380 --> 00:43:11.860
Back in the present time, Chōbei, Tōma,
Gantetsusai, and Fuchi all charge towards

00:43:11.860 --> 00:43:15.270
the Kishikai monster while constantly fending
off barrages of vines.

00:43:15.270 --> 00:43:19.250
Turning to the small man, Gantetsusai tells
him to give him some cover as he dives forth

00:43:19.250 --> 00:43:21.069
in an attempt to cut it down.

00:43:21.069 --> 00:43:25.359
Seeing him get hit directly though by multiple
vines, it causes Fuchi to think that the swordsman

00:43:25.359 --> 00:43:27.180
has almost reached his limit.

00:43:27.180 --> 00:43:30.900
The monster launches their spores towards
Fuchi but having seen the attack in time,

00:43:30.900 --> 00:43:33.780
is protected by Tōma who throws his own body
infront of it.

00:43:33.780 --> 00:43:38.680
Needing to snap Fuchi out of the daze he’s
in, Tōma shakes him around and explains that

00:43:38.680 --> 00:43:41.349
his tao is vital in their plan.

00:43:41.349 --> 00:43:45.829
Jumping up into the sky, Chōbei notices that
everyone is on their last legs, but this is

00:43:45.829 --> 00:43:48.390
it, they wont have another chance to win.

00:43:48.390 --> 00:43:52.079
Claiming that he’s ready now, the big man
himself manages to sneak under the monster

00:43:52.079 --> 00:43:57.470
through the water, before popping up and sending
a massive slash directly up through the immortal,

00:43:57.470 --> 00:44:01.030
cutting it in half and leaving the others
with a perfect opportunity to take it down.

00:44:01.030 --> 00:44:05.260
Fuchi, Tōma and Chōbei then come in from
both sides swinging their attacks towards

00:44:05.260 --> 00:44:06.260
the immortals.

00:44:06.260 --> 00:44:10.400
Ju Fa and Tao Fa try to reconnect into their
Kishikai form, but just before they are able

00:44:10.400 --> 00:44:14.890
to do so, our team successfully destroys the
Tanden of both immortals.

00:44:14.890 --> 00:44:18.720
Screaming for her partner, Tao Fa emerges
from the pool weakened but is quickly stopped

00:44:18.720 --> 00:44:24.200
and held in the arms by Fuchi who tells her
to stop as these are her final moments.

00:44:24.200 --> 00:44:28.270
Ju Fa then also climbs out of the water extremely
weakened and tries to attack Chōbei.

00:44:28.270 --> 00:44:32.500
Since his Tao won't be able to hinder them,
Chōbei punches himself in the gut and removes

00:44:32.500 --> 00:44:36.420
two bottles of Water Tao, that he originally
planned to use against Gabimaru.

00:44:36.420 --> 00:44:40.780
He then pours the liquid on Ju Fa, which almost
act like an acid to stop him from regenerating.

00:44:40.780 --> 00:44:45.240
Basking in victory, Chōbei just tells the
creature that he should have never picked

00:44:45.240 --> 00:44:47.619
a fight with the Aza brothers.

00:44:47.619 --> 00:44:51.580
Randomly Gantetsusai comes and finishes the
job entirely causing Chōbei to think that

00:44:51.580 --> 00:44:54.470
the man was taking pity on the creatures,
when in all reality man really did just want

00:44:54.470 --> 00:44:55.470
up the KD.

00:44:55.470 --> 00:44:59.450
In our big brutes head though his thoughts
are slightly different, while remembering

00:44:59.450 --> 00:45:04.100
Tao Fa's words from their last battle, he
kneels down and places a peach from Tao Fa's

00:45:04.100 --> 00:45:08.960
body next to Ju Fa, thanking her for the "fun"
they had throughout their battle.

00:45:08.960 --> 00:45:13.640
As he slowly dies and tears appear in his
eyes, Ju Fa apologizes to his girl for not

00:45:13.640 --> 00:45:15.620
being able to protect her.

00:45:15.620 --> 00:45:20.960
Now appearing as children (which obviously
represents the most sane and happiest time

00:45:20.960 --> 00:45:26.849
in both of their lives, before all of the
weirdness started) Eitherway the two then

00:45:26.849 --> 00:45:31.610
embrace each other in the afterlife with Tao
Fa saying that she was glad that he was her

00:45:31.610 --> 00:45:32.610
partner.

00:45:32.610 --> 00:45:36.050
Back in reality and with the battle having
been won, Fuchi wonders how the others are

00:45:36.050 --> 00:45:37.240
currents fairing.

00:45:37.240 --> 00:45:42.540
Then once again going back a bit earlier in
time, Sagiri and Mei encounter Gui Fa who

00:45:42.540 --> 00:45:46.410
says that he wont attack them if they don't
move from where they are, but also adds that

00:45:46.410 --> 00:45:50.280
he will absolutely crush them if they even
take once step forward.

00:45:50.280 --> 00:45:54.960
After arriving, Mei pointed out that this
was the Rentan Temple, yet Rien wasn't here

00:45:54.960 --> 00:45:58.050
so she just casually asked her fellow immortal
where they could've gone.

00:45:58.050 --> 00:46:02.600
Gui Fa says that Rien had left not to long
ago and he was given the task to guard the

00:46:02.600 --> 00:46:03.600
ritual circle.

00:46:03.600 --> 00:46:07.570
Gui Fa explains that the items infront of
him are meant to tell the fortune and current

00:46:07.570 --> 00:46:11.329
status of the humans fighting against the
other Tensen's, which is how he knew that

00:46:11.329 --> 00:46:13.230
her and Mei were on the way.

00:46:13.230 --> 00:46:17.030
Sagiri then reaches for her sword, causing
Gui Fa to emit their Tao towards Sagiri in

00:46:17.030 --> 00:46:20.750
a similar manner to someone overwhelming a
person with their aura, which causes Sagiri

00:46:20.750 --> 00:46:22.819
to collapse from the pressure.

00:46:22.819 --> 00:46:26.500
Impressed with the fact she can still move,
Gui Fa tells that that if she does continue

00:46:26.500 --> 00:46:28.670
to resist he will crush her.

00:46:28.670 --> 00:46:32.790
Sagiri explains that she doesn't wish to fight
and instead places her sword on the ground

00:46:32.790 --> 00:46:37.090
while apologizing for invading their island
along with their behaviour since then.

00:46:37.090 --> 00:46:41.220
With that said though, she finds it pathetic
how now he tries to stop her when all along

00:46:41.220 --> 00:46:43.710
they were purposely luring people to the island.

00:46:43.710 --> 00:46:48.520
This conflict is merely an extension of what
they sowed and sadly with how things are now,

00:46:48.520 --> 00:46:51.150
its only going to result in more losses.

00:46:51.150 --> 00:46:55.910
In an attempt to prevent this, Sagiri offers
a declaration of peace between both sides,

00:46:55.910 --> 00:46:59.599
they will leave and the immortals will allow
it to happen without delay.

00:46:59.599 --> 00:47:04.030
Hearing this, Gui Fa drops the hold he had
over Sagiri and allows her to move.

00:47:04.030 --> 00:47:08.530
However, he warns them that even if they return
back to Woguo it would be pointless.

00:47:08.530 --> 00:47:12.319
Wanting to know what he meant by this, Gui
Fa explains to the two through an illusion

00:47:12.319 --> 00:47:16.800
created with Tao, that Rien's true plan is
to depart Hōrai on a ship and release the

00:47:16.800 --> 00:47:21.490
Paradise Butterflies on to the mainland, turning
every human into Waitanhua flowers.

00:47:21.490 --> 00:47:25.640
Then once all of the humans had turned they
would form together into one giant Banko,

00:47:25.640 --> 00:47:28.510
called the divine BEAST BANKO.

00:47:28.510 --> 00:47:33.480
From that Rien can finally produce the much
sought after perfected Tan.

00:47:33.480 --> 00:47:37.520
Hearing this shakes our girl to her core as
finally for the first time in the series someone

00:47:37.520 --> 00:47:42.130
of normal sanity found out the truth about
Rien's maniacal plan.

00:47:42.130 --> 00:47:48.520
Btw Waguo is the ancient Chinese name for
Japan, pronounced Wakoku in Japanese.

00:47:48.520 --> 00:47:54.300
Funnily enough the name came about in the
3rd century and literally meant dwarf country.

00:47:54.300 --> 00:47:58.730
Later on in the 7th century and to amend their
short shaming the Japanese people changed

00:47:58.730 --> 00:48:00.351
the Kanji up to mean peace and harmony.

00:48:00.351 --> 00:48:01.351
Still rambling on here but its actually crazy
how many times the names changed, like even

00:48:01.351 --> 00:48:02.351
now there's still Nippon, Nihon, Jipang and
finally Japan itself.

00:48:02.351 --> 00:48:03.351
ANNNYWAYS

00:48:03.351 --> 00:48:04.351
Sagiri asks Gui Fa why?

00:48:04.351 --> 00:48:07.210
Why would they all go to these lengths, what
could possibly be motivating them?

00:48:07.210 --> 00:48:11.320
Gui Fa answers that they as in him and the
other Tensen, feel nothing for humans and

00:48:11.320 --> 00:48:15.240
that they are materials for them to use in
order to make an elixir.

00:48:15.240 --> 00:48:19.280
Hearing this change in her old friend, Mei
objects to this statement, saying that Jofuku's

00:48:19.280 --> 00:48:22.670
original research was for the good of mankind
and using lives isn't.

00:48:22.670 --> 00:48:27.540
Yet in the Gui Fa’s eyes, they've all changed,
ever since one specific day in which they

00:48:27.540 --> 00:48:32.210
all tested a specific method and managed to
lure in the first group of humans to the island.

00:48:32.210 --> 00:48:36.819
On that day they learned just how beautiful
and delicious humans truly are.

00:48:36.819 --> 00:48:41.420
It was more than they ever expected, humans
outside of Hōrai were weak frail things,

00:48:41.420 --> 00:48:44.599
yet they possessed far more exquisite materials.

00:48:44.599 --> 00:48:48.500
The reason for this is because humans are
beings full of doubt and indecision, they

00:48:48.500 --> 00:48:52.560
waver between the extremes which itself is
the essence of Tao.

00:48:52.560 --> 00:48:54.640
Love and hate, life and death.

00:48:54.640 --> 00:48:59.290
Due to the Tensen being born as higher beings
they simply cant fathom those aspects of Tao,

00:48:59.290 --> 00:49:03.290
so to Gui Fa its frankly unthinkable that
they would look for a more suitable form of

00:49:03.290 --> 00:49:05.819
immortality elixir at this point.

00:49:05.819 --> 00:49:10.140
With the elixir completed by Rien, Gui Fa
also says that to come to an understanding

00:49:10.140 --> 00:49:15.060
would be meaningless and all they can do now
is to try and steal more lives from the others.

00:49:15.060 --> 00:49:18.860
Looking over his shoulder the dude then points
out that as they speak Shion's talisman is

00:49:18.860 --> 00:49:23.230
beginning to burn up, symbolizing that in
his battle, he’s nearing the end of his

00:49:23.230 --> 00:49:24.230
road.

00:49:24.230 --> 00:49:28.770
In his fight with Zhu Jin, Shion manages to
cut the immortals body two hundred n fifteen

00:49:28.770 --> 00:49:29.770
times.

00:49:29.770 --> 00:49:33.450
Looking at the thing infront of him, he comes
to a quick conclusion that his plan is working,

00:49:33.450 --> 00:49:36.460
the creature is beginning to slow its regeneration
speed.

00:49:36.460 --> 00:49:40.540
Walking up to it once more, Shion absolutely
exhausted continues to attack, slicing the

00:49:40.540 --> 00:49:42.549
thing in half once more.

00:49:42.549 --> 00:49:46.069
After getting right above the creature, Zhu
Jin quickly springs back and manages to get

00:49:46.069 --> 00:49:48.760
some distance between them in an attempt to
regenerate.

00:49:48.760 --> 00:49:52.640
Nurugai goes to attack herself, but Shion
holds her back while explaining that the monster

00:49:52.640 --> 00:49:55.049
itself is also just as knackered.

00:49:55.049 --> 00:49:59.790
Terrorfied and unable to take him out, Zhu
Jin asks what in the world Shion is as he

00:49:59.790 --> 00:50:01.799
defiantly isn't normal.

00:50:01.799 --> 00:50:06.300
Remembering the moment where everything first
changed Shion grits his teeth and tells the

00:50:06.300 --> 00:50:11.220
feign that those who steal the lives of other
willingly could never under stand, while those

00:50:11.220 --> 00:50:14.440
who've been stolen from will never forget.

00:50:14.440 --> 00:50:18.609
Looking like an actual 80 year old bag of
bones Zhu Jin defends themselves by attacking

00:50:18.609 --> 00:50:21.599
the duo with the remains of all of the other
bodies that have been generated throughout

00:50:21.599 --> 00:50:22.599
the battle.

00:50:22.599 --> 00:50:26.210
However, Shion sees through the his opponent's
ruse and slices the Tao infused bodies to

00:50:26.210 --> 00:50:27.210
bits.

00:50:27.210 --> 00:50:31.030
He then jumps forth using his infamous Itto
Ryu Harvest Shower but fails to land a hit

00:50:31.030 --> 00:50:32.080
on the fleeing immortal.

00:50:32.080 --> 00:50:36.250
Zhu Jin initially thinks Shion misjudged the
distance between them, but the reality of

00:50:36.250 --> 00:50:40.650
his attack was revealed when the blind king
acting like he has perfect 20/20 vision fakes

00:50:40.650 --> 00:50:44.350
a trip to grabs the tip of his sword from
the ground and throws it towards Zhu Jin's

00:50:44.350 --> 00:50:45.350
tanden.

00:50:45.350 --> 00:50:49.109
Getting up from his injury Zhu Jin sees that
Shion himself is just as exhausted from using

00:50:49.109 --> 00:50:52.980
too much of his Tao and in that moment takes
the opportunity to attack.

00:50:52.980 --> 00:50:57.010
Nurugai runs towards Shion to assist him but
as per usual, she is told to stay back as

00:50:57.010 --> 00:50:58.740
he doesn't want to put her in danger.

00:50:58.740 --> 00:51:04.250
Sadly Zhu Jin uses this moment to her advantage
and seemingly crushes Shion with the Tao bodies.

00:51:04.250 --> 00:51:07.690
Laughing out loud thinking that she's managed
to take down one of her opponents, Zhu Jin

00:51:07.690 --> 00:51:11.250
is promptly gobsmacked as they watch Shion
slice his way out the coffin.

00:51:11.250 --> 00:51:16.630
In utter shock at Shion's determination, Zhu
Jin asks why he would shave away at his own

00:51:16.630 --> 00:51:20.290
life force and go so far to avenge his fallen
comrade.

00:51:20.290 --> 00:51:24.280
Standing there utterly broken over everything
thats happened on the island, Shion explains

00:51:24.280 --> 00:51:28.291
that he hasn't had a single chance to feel
grief or mourn, at times he even finds it

00:51:28.291 --> 00:51:30.339
difficult to rage.

00:51:30.339 --> 00:51:34.540
Still no matter what, he states that until
he managed to rid the earth of these pathetic

00:51:34.540 --> 00:51:37.869
creatures, the grief, despair, NOTHING will
return to him.

00:51:37.869 --> 00:51:42.000
He wonders how many more hundreds of cuts
itl take until he can finally put his student

00:51:42.000 --> 00:51:44.599
and best friend to rest.

00:51:44.599 --> 00:51:48.340
Literally just in fear for their life at this
point, the creature makes a last ditch effort

00:51:48.340 --> 00:51:51.090
to heal itself by slipping backwards into
the water.

00:51:51.090 --> 00:51:55.099
Coming back up its shown that somehow in just
a matter of moments Zhu Jin was able to heal

00:51:55.099 --> 00:51:58.059
themselves by taking a leaf out of Gui Fa’s
book.

00:51:58.059 --> 00:52:05.310
So unlike all of the others who partake in
Bochu Jutsu, Gui Fa doesn't, instead he maintains

00:52:05.310 --> 00:52:07.619
a middle ground between both Yin and Yang.

00:52:07.619 --> 00:52:12.240
Zhu Jin then tries something new on the side
of the Tensen's and begins to partially transform

00:52:12.240 --> 00:52:14.619
their body into their Kishikai form.

00:52:14.619 --> 00:52:19.319
Standing there and looking super freaking
clean, like the fit actually goes hard the

00:52:19.319 --> 00:52:24.680
immortal taunts Shion, asking if it was still
possible for him to land all those cuts.

00:52:24.680 --> 00:52:28.119
Just like with Tenza, Zhu Jin states that
it has accustomed to their tricks and its

00:52:28.119 --> 00:52:31.750
fairly evident as the three begin their fight
once more that Shion and Nurugai are only

00:52:31.750 --> 00:52:35.210
barely able to hold on against the partial
Kishikai form.

00:52:35.210 --> 00:52:36.210
Tricks though?

00:52:36.210 --> 00:52:39.280
this statement said by Zhu Jin hits probably
one of the saddest notes within one of our

00:52:39.280 --> 00:52:43.579
favorite characters as that is literally who
Shion is, a trickster.

00:52:43.579 --> 00:52:47.770
He couldn't care what this pathetic amalgamation
of leaves thought, his mother was the one

00:52:47.770 --> 00:52:49.410
who gave him these scars.

00:52:49.410 --> 00:52:53.440
He was always born blind, but because he was
also born as a travelling performer, it was

00:52:53.440 --> 00:52:57.680
a necessity to trick people into giving them
some measly donations to live.

00:52:57.680 --> 00:53:01.599
Over time he came to be known as the divine
boy who could see through anyone's swordsmanship

00:53:01.599 --> 00:53:03.250
without even seeing.

00:53:03.250 --> 00:53:08.049
Moving forth through his life Shion remembers
how it one day led him into the Tōdōza (which

00:53:08.049 --> 00:53:12.510
is a real life guild for blind men to join
and the Kengyo was the highest ranking member

00:53:12.510 --> 00:53:17.660
of that org, it lasted from the 14th century
all the through to 1871 and there was also

00:53:17.660 --> 00:53:19.790
a female section called Gozeza.

00:53:19.790 --> 00:53:24.960
The highest ranking member which was the Grand
Kengyo was said to have equal authority to

00:53:24.960 --> 00:53:29.710
a Daimyo) Once that said Kengyo in Hells Paradise
heard of Shions abilities, it was through

00:53:29.710 --> 00:53:33.000
him that he managed to end up as a student
of the Yamada clan.

00:53:33.000 --> 00:53:36.670
To not sully his mother's honor, Shion went
along with the false backstory that he was

00:53:36.670 --> 00:53:40.640
the illegitimate child of a famous swordsman
and kept his real past life a secret from

00:53:40.640 --> 00:53:41.940
the Yamada clan.

00:53:41.940 --> 00:53:45.070
Even still this fact shames him to his core.

00:53:45.070 --> 00:53:48.960
After becoming a fully grown adult and hearing
Tenza speak his mind to Shugen about how he

00:53:48.960 --> 00:53:52.730
should see him for what he is now, along with
watching him gradually gain acceptance despite

00:53:52.730 --> 00:53:56.680
his past, Shion becomes inspired to be like
his student, just like how he grew him into

00:53:56.680 --> 00:53:58.270
the man he was.

00:53:58.270 --> 00:54:02.010
Back in the present, Shion blocks one of Zhu
Jin's attacks and states no matter what, if

00:54:02.010 --> 00:54:07.240
its just this one IT WILL DIE BY HIS HAND,
HE WILL GLADLY GIVE HIS LIFE FOR THAT CAUSE.

00:54:07.240 --> 00:54:10.680
Quickly leaning back he dodges Zhu Jin's lightning
Tao attack and hears them gloating about how

00:54:10.680 --> 00:54:12.799
he does not stand a chance against their power.

00:54:12.799 --> 00:54:16.680
Shion angrily silences Zhu Jin before they
could finish their sentence and declares that

00:54:16.680 --> 00:54:17.730
he will defeat them.

00:54:17.730 --> 00:54:22.540
That form is just a cheap trick that prioritizes
performance over dealing destructive blows.

00:54:22.540 --> 00:54:26.540
He tells Nurugai to stay back as he will end
this himself, before rushing in and detaching

00:54:26.540 --> 00:54:32.079
Zhu Jin's left hand, then in the same movement
plunges his snapped Katana deep into her Tanden.

00:54:32.079 --> 00:54:34.940
Remembering the survivors strategy meeting
about how they need to target Lord Tensen's

00:54:34.940 --> 00:54:39.750
plant like ovules to deal the finishing blow,
Shion disembodies Zhu Jin with his blade.

00:54:39.750 --> 00:54:44.480
Then standing above presses his sword down
on the Tensen's ovule to end the battle.

00:54:44.480 --> 00:54:48.280
While doing so, Shion is suddenly assaulted
by the remains of Zhu Jin sending a bunch

00:54:48.280 --> 00:54:50.460
of vines shooting into his body.

00:54:50.460 --> 00:54:54.400
Mei explains that they need to pull the blade
out otherwise the ovule will continue to attack

00:54:54.400 --> 00:54:56.560
the one who holds it down.

00:54:56.560 --> 00:55:00.730
However, Shion continues to press down on
his sword knowing that if they both die then

00:55:00.730 --> 00:55:03.040
he will still be victorious in the end.

00:55:03.040 --> 00:55:07.369
Nurugai worries that if Shion continues with
holding the sword down then he will die, however,

00:55:07.369 --> 00:55:09.010
Shion tells her to stay back.

00:55:09.010 --> 00:55:12.980
He expresses the pain he felt as he left Tenza
behind to fight for their lives and pleas

00:55:12.980 --> 00:55:17.000
to Nurugai to leave him behind as he takes
responsibility for past his actions.

00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:20.650
He finds it horrid that he made the correct
choice to flee in the past and now all he

00:55:20.650 --> 00:55:24.880
can do is this, his eyes don't shed tears
so he’s unable to show how much he truly

00:55:24.880 --> 00:55:25.880
cared.

00:55:25.880 --> 00:55:29.900
Nurugai tries to intervene and talk to him
but Shion just demands that she flee’s,

00:55:29.900 --> 00:55:33.780
causing her to turn and run away as tears
begin to fall from her face.

00:55:33.780 --> 00:55:37.380
She knows exactly what her Sensei’s going
through now as she’s been in the exact same

00:55:37.380 --> 00:55:38.380
shoes.

00:55:38.380 --> 00:55:42.731
She could never forgive herself, instead she
thought she was the reason everyone in her

00:55:42.731 --> 00:55:43.970
life died.

00:55:43.970 --> 00:55:48.190
Yet after meeting Tenza, seeing his actions
and hearing him say that he was unable to

00:55:48.190 --> 00:55:52.700
accept her reason for wanting to die, it causes
her to stop and look at the blade infront

00:55:52.700 --> 00:55:53.809
of her.

00:55:53.809 --> 00:55:58.200
Beginning to walk now She then sees a vision
of Tenza bending down infront of her before

00:55:58.200 --> 00:56:01.440
standing up and gifting Nurugai back her blade.

00:56:01.440 --> 00:56:05.160
Nurugai tries to explain her situation but
before she can even verbalize what's going

00:56:05.160 --> 00:56:09.380
on, Tenza holds out her blade with one hand
and says that if thats the case then there's

00:56:09.380 --> 00:56:11.220
only one thing to do.

00:56:11.220 --> 00:56:15.580
Encouraged by her man, Nurugai grabs the blade
and boosts it back towards the palace.

00:56:15.580 --> 00:56:18.950
Inside of the building Shion is fully covered
with the vines and sadly starting to feel

00:56:18.950 --> 00:56:20.569
his life being eaten away.

00:56:20.569 --> 00:56:25.119
This alone to him confirms that just like
him, the immortal is also slowly beginning

00:56:25.119 --> 00:56:26.359
to fade away.

00:56:26.359 --> 00:56:30.700
However, Nurugai suddenly fly's through tackling
Shion and freeing him from the death grip

00:56:30.700 --> 00:56:31.809
he was in.

00:56:31.809 --> 00:56:36.039
After tearing away the remaining vines, Nurugai
bear hugs her Sensei in an attempt to restore

00:56:36.039 --> 00:56:37.319
his Tao.

00:56:37.319 --> 00:56:41.280
Sitting there absolutely exhausted now, Nurugai
points out that the immortal is slowly regenerating,

00:56:41.280 --> 00:56:45.599
but at this speed itl most likely take a whole
day to recover.

00:56:45.599 --> 00:56:49.740
Shion believes that they should take it out
while its nice n easy, Nurugai objects though

00:56:49.740 --> 00:56:52.829
and tells him that thats exactly why they've
got to leave.

00:56:52.829 --> 00:56:56.619
If anyone even tries to get close to the creature
when its in that state then the vines will

00:56:56.619 --> 00:57:01.319
immediately skewer anyone, so instead they
should get to the others.

00:57:01.319 --> 00:57:06.750
Shion cant though, he finds it impossible
to leave while that specific creature still

00:57:06.750 --> 00:57:08.109
sucks in air.

00:57:08.109 --> 00:57:09.109
Finally...

00:57:09.109 --> 00:57:12.289
Nurugai tells him that that isn't it, he’s
wrong.

00:57:12.289 --> 00:57:14.740
Tenza never died with pain or regrets.

00:57:14.740 --> 00:57:16.519
She saw it with her own eyes...

00:57:16.519 --> 00:57:20.510
He was smiling because he knew that the people
he loved were able to escape.

00:57:20.510 --> 00:57:26.410
It was the smile of someone who was proud
in their final moments, but also an air of

00:57:26.410 --> 00:57:30.089
sadness, she doesn't think that he regretted
a thing about his final moments.

00:57:30.089 --> 00:57:33.869
Walking up to him, Nurugai hugs Shion and
asks that instead of holding revenge in his

00:57:33.869 --> 00:57:37.670
heart, he tell her all about the man that
he used to be.

00:57:37.670 --> 00:57:41.760
After Shion looks towards the blade embedded
in Zhu Jin, he notices a reflection of Tenza

00:57:41.760 --> 00:57:44.300
beside him and Nurugai.

00:57:44.300 --> 00:57:48.590
Finally feeling somewhat at peace, Shion thanks
Nurugai for reasoning with him and agrees

00:57:48.590 --> 00:57:49.930
to leave.

00:57:49.930 --> 00:57:54.370
Back over at the ritual circle, two bottles
suddenly shatter while another slowly begins

00:57:54.370 --> 00:57:55.370
to crack.

00:57:55.370 --> 00:57:59.090
This here obviously indicates that instead
of the criminals or executioners, the members

00:57:59.090 --> 00:58:02.750
of Lord Tensen have been defeated.

00:58:02.750 --> 00:58:06.569
Noticing that the talismans remained intact
after the battles concluded, Sagiri believes

00:58:06.569 --> 00:58:08.960
that Gabimaru and the others are still alive.

00:58:08.960 --> 00:58:13.280
With the ritual pretty much over, Gui Fa gets
up and prepares to report to Rien.

00:58:13.280 --> 00:58:18.070
Confused, Sagiri questions Gui Fa why they
weren't willing to avenge their comrades.

00:58:18.070 --> 00:58:22.339
Pretty much this is just due to the fact that
these Tensen supposedly carry no emotions

00:58:22.339 --> 00:58:23.740
or bonds with one another.

00:58:23.740 --> 00:58:28.309
Instead their passing's were merely a larger
part of their training in the way of Yin and

00:58:28.309 --> 00:58:29.309
Yang.

00:58:29.309 --> 00:58:34.059
Gui Fa even reminds Mei that the same went
for her, the Tensen are beings that only ‘Seek

00:58:34.059 --> 00:58:40.359
The Way’ no bonds or emotions, what they've
seen is only an act created by a lost child.

00:58:40.359 --> 00:58:44.700
Confused as to why she would ever reveal herself
after leaving, Gui Fa inquires as to why she

00:58:44.700 --> 00:58:45.700
came back.

00:58:45.700 --> 00:58:50.359
Our lil Mei still hardly able to verbalize
herself just answers that she finally understands

00:58:50.359 --> 00:58:52.100
what life means.

00:58:52.100 --> 00:58:56.049
Turning back, Gui Fa just sadly responds that
he does indeed envies her.

00:58:56.049 --> 00:59:03.650
(Honestly Gui Fa along with Ju Fa were really
the only 2 Tensen to see how messed up their

00:59:03.650 --> 00:59:08.240
ways had become, obviously Mei understands
aswell hence why she left.

00:59:08.240 --> 00:59:11.950
I just think the reason the other 2 didnt
is because they do truly have emotions and

00:59:11.950 --> 00:59:14.840
never wanted to break away from what they’d
come to know.

00:59:14.840 --> 00:59:18.910
Eitherway everyone is suddenly taken off-guard
as the palace then begins to violently shake

00:59:18.910 --> 00:59:23.460
with Gui Fa saying that the situation has
taken a turn for the worse.

00:59:23.460 --> 00:59:28.950
Outside its revealed that the maniacal maniac,
the order 66 merchant, Rank 2 Yamada Asaemon

00:59:28.950 --> 00:59:32.960
Shugen riding atop his Mōnshin smashes through
the wall that made up Horai’s surroundings.

00:59:32.960 --> 00:59:37.340
Back over with the largest squad and after
giving Gantetsusai an eyepatch to help protect

00:59:37.340 --> 00:59:42.090
his left eye, Fuchi, Tōma, and big g have
a comedic discussion in its positioning.

00:59:42.090 --> 00:59:46.619
Chōbei hilariously interrupts their conversation,
calling them utter fools for weeing away time,

00:59:46.619 --> 00:59:49.619
and quickly brings their focus back to the
main issue at hand.

00:59:49.619 --> 00:59:54.240
He reveals to them all Rien's plan of turning
every human in Japan into Tan and synchronizing

00:59:54.240 --> 00:59:56.589
them all with the monster called Banko.

00:59:56.589 --> 01:00:00.060
He also remembers how Rien told him that he
was confident that the other Tensen wouldn't

01:00:00.060 --> 01:00:05.240
die, but also stated that if they did happen
to then it would not matter to him.

01:00:05.240 --> 01:00:09.109
Chōbei listens to Gantetsusai's compliant
about how he finds the situation far too complicated

01:00:09.109 --> 01:00:12.640
and also agrees with Fuchi's suggestion on
his eyepatch, much to the Asaemon's happiness.

01:00:12.640 --> 01:00:18.380
Tōma getting a lil curious as to what his
bro got upto with the Tensen inquires but

01:00:18.380 --> 01:00:22.549
is utterly shocked after Chōbei reveals that
he engaged in Bōchū Jutsu and was constantly

01:00:22.549 --> 01:00:23.589
experimented on.

01:00:23.589 --> 01:00:27.549
Knowing that they must stop Rien and retrieve
a ship from the floodgate to escape themselves,

01:00:27.549 --> 01:00:30.670
Fuchi asks Chōbei if he is willing to ally
with them.

01:00:30.670 --> 01:00:34.910
Before he could give his answer, the four
suddenly feel the room tremble.

01:00:34.910 --> 01:00:39.170
Meanwhile, Nurugai helps Shion up so the two
can walk together while he’s still injured.

01:00:39.170 --> 01:00:43.600
Shion ensures Nurugai that even if things
don't go as plan and they end up in the worst

01:00:43.600 --> 01:00:48.460
possible scenario, then he will ensure that
she’s still able to survive and return home.

01:00:48.460 --> 01:00:53.000
Edo though would not be their destination,
instead they will roam the country together.

01:00:53.000 --> 01:00:57.140
In the current time period there are still
a fair few mountain clans that remain hidden,

01:00:57.140 --> 01:00:59.089
maybe living that life will suit them both.

01:00:59.089 --> 01:01:03.730
He gets down on his knees and promises that
so long as the life burns in his eyes he will

01:01:03.730 --> 01:01:06.270
be her protector until that day comes.

01:01:06.270 --> 01:01:11.080
The two then get into a comedic discussion
about another one of Shions blind metaphors,

01:01:11.080 --> 01:01:14.980
when they both suddenly feel the palace starting
to shake.

01:01:14.980 --> 01:01:18.520
After the tremors settled down, Shion is unable
to detect what caused it.

01:01:18.520 --> 01:01:22.500
All around them though, appearing from the
darkness Iwa ninja masks break through from

01:01:22.500 --> 01:01:25.970
the shadows, with one in front of the duo
telling them that they have been ordered by

01:01:25.970 --> 01:01:30.220
Shugen to eliminate all convicts and any Asaemon
who have sided with them.

01:01:30.220 --> 01:01:34.000
At the same time, Gantetsusai and the other
3 there along with a currently an unconscious

01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:35.900
Gabimaru are surrounded by other various ninja.

01:01:35.900 --> 01:01:40.901
Instantly the ninja around Gabi lash out in
an attempt to take him out, however, Gabimaru

01:01:40.901 --> 01:01:44.690
wakes up and in one perfect motion takes out
all four enemies.

01:01:44.690 --> 01:01:47.440
After looking down and realizing that it was
Iwa ninja’s he just merked, Gabimaru deduced

01:01:47.440 --> 01:01:55.550
that the next Gabimaru is here.

01:01:55.550 --> 01:02:00.140
So in a flashback during the first night they
camped out on the island, its shown that Sagiri

01:02:00.140 --> 01:02:04.420
was constantly told by Gabimaru that she was
feeling sleepy, even though she denies it.

01:02:04.420 --> 01:02:08.289
She recommends that he sleep after the battles
he fought but is quickly told that people

01:02:08.289 --> 01:02:11.950
like him in Iwa are able to go for at least
10 days without sleep.

01:02:11.950 --> 01:02:16.299
With this in mind she asked as to why Gabimaru
was even worried about people coming after

01:02:16.299 --> 01:02:17.299
him.

01:02:17.299 --> 01:02:21.029
Gabimaru tells Sagiri that he has no doubt
that they’ll track him down and find him.

01:02:21.029 --> 01:02:25.150
Hearing him, Sagiri becomes confused by this
as like why would they go out of their way

01:02:25.150 --> 01:02:27.020
for just one stray ninja.

01:02:27.020 --> 01:02:32.799
So this is like Gabimaru reveals, for one
simple fact, the connotation "Gabimaru the

01:02:32.799 --> 01:02:37.810
Hollow", is a codename meant to carry and
pass down Iwagakure's strongest shinobi.

01:02:37.810 --> 01:02:42.490
Bruh saying Gabimaru 12 times in one sentence
here is finna make my brain implode haha,

01:02:42.490 --> 01:02:43.490
eitherway.

01:02:43.490 --> 01:02:46.359
Well remember when the chief found Gabi with
his merked parents, turns out that the dude

01:02:46.359 --> 01:02:49.000
there next to him was the previous Gabimaru.

01:02:49.000 --> 01:02:53.359
He wasn't telling our Gabi to necessarily
behold weakness, but instead the current Gabimaru

01:02:53.359 --> 01:02:57.750
of that time who im guessing was the one who
merked our Gabi’s parents.

01:02:57.750 --> 01:03:02.700
Otherwise how did the dude gain the position,
unless Gabi’s parents were just tryna leave

01:03:02.700 --> 01:03:06.760
and its me who’s read it wrong but oh well.

01:03:06.760 --> 01:03:11.829
Back when Senta was alive and during the time
Yuzuriha and him ran off to evade the flames

01:03:11.829 --> 01:03:14.809
she actually explained this exact possibility
to the weeb king.

01:03:14.809 --> 01:03:19.069
She went over the horrific tale of "Gabimaru
the Hollow" and how the name alone was the

01:03:19.069 --> 01:03:20.770
only thing she new was real.

01:03:20.770 --> 01:03:24.980
She’s almost certain she heard tales about
how even if Gabimaru was slain he still somehow

01:03:24.980 --> 01:03:28.380
shows back up and wreaks even more havoc than
before.

01:03:28.380 --> 01:03:33.829
Decades pass but this name never ages or dies,
its as if its as living breathing representation

01:03:33.829 --> 01:03:35.240
of terror.

01:03:35.240 --> 01:03:39.319
Seemingly falling into a flashback of our
Gabi’s own memories, it shows the Iwagakure

01:03:39.319 --> 01:03:42.670
chief telling the potential young Gabimaru
candidates on how he will pick from one of

01:03:42.670 --> 01:03:44.020
them to become the next inheritor.

01:03:44.020 --> 01:03:50.000
During the training, the chief sets his sights
on the young Gabimaru for his impressive skills

01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:51.760
and his lack of emotions.

01:03:51.760 --> 01:03:57.520
Soooo Gabi used to be kinda diiiiferent, this
dumb kid threw a rock at his head one time

01:03:57.520 --> 01:04:03.660
and well yeah ahh, Gabi didnt have middle
ground.

01:04:03.660 --> 01:04:08.130
After finding what happened the Chief asks
the previous Gabimaru on the one who committed

01:04:08.130 --> 01:04:12.300
this act and its assumed that our Gabi kinda
popped off.

01:04:12.300 --> 01:04:17.820
As the early days brutalization continued,
the chief takes note of how each victim separated

01:04:17.820 --> 01:04:23.020
the young Gabimaru from the weak so that now
only those who are like minded equals remain.

01:04:23.020 --> 01:04:27.309
Later on, one of the shinobi comes up to Gabimaru
after becoming impressed that he carried out

01:04:27.309 --> 01:04:28.890
a dangerous mission.

01:04:28.890 --> 01:04:32.990
With admirers and peers that envy him, along
with having true talent, the chief decides

01:04:32.990 --> 01:04:36.390
that Gabimaru will be the next shinobi to
inherit the alias.

01:04:36.390 --> 01:04:40.390
The chief tells Gabimaru that he has chosen
him as the next successor and must complete

01:04:40.390 --> 01:04:44.970
a ceremony where he has to take out the current
Gabimaru in a fight to the death.

01:04:44.970 --> 01:04:50.390
Im assuming this is with absolute ease as
we don't even see it, the previous Gabi got

01:04:50.390 --> 01:04:52.900
off screened by our boy in a matter of moments.

01:04:52.900 --> 01:04:57.320
Overly enjoyed with just how broken Gabimaru
is, the chief screams in delights that he

01:04:57.320 --> 01:05:00.839
will become history's strongest Gabimaru the
Hollow.

01:05:00.839 --> 01:05:05.539
In the present, Shugen orders the ninja to
execute any lifeform they come across, except

01:05:05.539 --> 01:05:07.010
the other surviving Yamada.

01:05:07.010 --> 01:05:11.800
Then just as abruptly leaves with Isuzu and
Kiyomaru, while nearby Jikka decides guard

01:05:11.800 --> 01:05:15.869
the rear when in all actuality mans tryna
do the least work possible.

01:05:15.869 --> 01:05:19.619
Looking up to the ninja next to him Jikka
says that he knows this whole obey the Shogunate

01:05:19.619 --> 01:05:23.500
concept is just a front at use to hide their
own agenda on the mission.

01:05:23.500 --> 01:05:27.720
Thinking back this specific ninja remembers
the chief's orders to kill Gabimaru in order

01:05:27.720 --> 01:05:31.089
to become the next "Gabimaru the Hollow" themselves.

01:05:31.089 --> 01:05:34.730
Standing up though she tells Jikka that they
share the same goal since at the end of the

01:05:34.730 --> 01:05:37.890
day their objective is to kill everyone else
on the island.

01:05:37.890 --> 01:05:41.740
However, the ninja tells themselves that the
only thing that was more important than actually

01:05:41.740 --> 01:05:44.450
taking out Gabi was to bring "him" back.

01:05:44.450 --> 01:05:49.130
Looking up with a maniacal expression the
ninja just remembers that after all she was

01:05:49.130 --> 01:05:53.300
the one who slaughtered everyone in his way
and took out those that were envious of his

01:05:53.300 --> 01:05:54.300
success.

01:05:54.300 --> 01:05:55.300
In a flashback we see the time were Gabimaru
for the first time realized who it was that

01:05:55.300 --> 01:05:56.300
was taking out all of his competition.

01:05:56.300 --> 01:05:58.829
After confronting her, the ninja admits to
this, she explains that they’ve been supporting

01:05:58.829 --> 01:06:02.869
him all along from the shadows and confesses
their feelings to him, that they love him,

01:06:02.869 --> 01:06:06.770
they'd be happy to die by his hand or kill
him.

01:06:06.770 --> 01:06:11.319
Bruh Yuki just came out the bag with the maxed
out clingy ex gf.

01:06:11.319 --> 01:06:14.770
Holy thats like the personification of crazy
crazy.

01:06:14.770 --> 01:06:19.740
Also on another note, those masks all the
Ninja wear resemble ones used in Noh theater.

01:06:19.740 --> 01:06:22.700
Noh drama is the oldest surviving form of
Japanese theater.

01:06:22.700 --> 01:06:26.910
It combines music, dance, and acting to communicate
Buddhist themes.

01:06:26.910 --> 01:06:31.829
The tradition began throughout the Muromachi
period with around 60 masks that originally

01:06:31.829 --> 01:06:33.309
had religious connotations.

01:06:33.309 --> 01:06:38.190
Funnily enough and you all probably saw this
coming, Gabi’s crazy girl we just meet wears

01:06:38.190 --> 01:06:40.550
the mask that represents a jealous female
demon.

01:06:40.550 --> 01:06:45.220
Back in the depths of Hōrai inside of the
floodgates, Rien senses the tremors coming

01:06:45.220 --> 01:06:49.460
from outside and is also reported to by Gui
Fa that the other remaining Tensen have been

01:06:49.460 --> 01:06:53.369
killed, the Rite of Just Consumption has failed,
and extremely skilled human reinforcements

01:06:53.369 --> 01:06:54.539
have arrived.

01:06:54.539 --> 01:06:58.539
With no other choice, Rien stages a counterattack
by sending the Dōshi out for battle while

01:06:58.539 --> 01:07:01.020
keeping a minimum with him as protection..

01:07:01.020 --> 01:07:05.210
As they rush towards the battlefield, Rien
reiterates that this is war, the losses and

01:07:05.210 --> 01:07:09.461
outcome of this battle matter not, before
long everything should return to how it once

01:07:09.461 --> 01:07:10.770
was.

01:07:10.770 --> 01:07:15.829
Above ground now, everyone including the Doshi
riding their steeds begin throwing hands.

01:07:15.829 --> 01:07:19.900
Seeing as how they cant manage to defeat every
fodder opponent, Gantetsusai, Fuchi, Tōma,

01:07:19.900 --> 01:07:23.150
and Chōbei decide to instead make a run for
it.

01:07:23.150 --> 01:07:26.880
Over in another battle, Shion procures himself
a sword from one of the ninja and is told

01:07:26.880 --> 01:07:28.770
by Nurugai to follow her to safety.

01:07:28.770 --> 01:07:32.859
While sprinting away themselves, Gantetsusai
lets them all know that he knows a think or

01:07:32.859 --> 01:07:34.829
two about experiencing war.

01:07:34.829 --> 01:07:38.520
These fights there currently in go way beyond
just pitting strength against strength.

01:07:38.520 --> 01:07:43.299
In war living and dying is complete luck,
there's no fun about the battles and no pride

01:07:43.299 --> 01:07:44.849
at all to be won.

01:07:44.849 --> 01:07:49.270
Its only hell on earth and the people who
survive are only those that run, those who

01:07:49.270 --> 01:07:54.180
have pawns do their bidding and the complete
madmen with the gods on their side.

01:07:54.180 --> 01:07:58.760
Over with one of those madmen and as the Dōshi
army charges towards him, Shugen remembers

01:07:58.760 --> 01:08:04.220
Eizen and is driven to cut down the entire
freaking army in only a few deadly swings.

01:08:04.220 --> 01:08:08.410
After seeing Shugen's battle skills, Kiyomaru
asked him if had some experience with war,

01:08:08.410 --> 01:08:12.240
however he’s quickly told by him that this
battle isn't war, its an execution to purge

01:08:12.240 --> 01:08:15.270
the scum who dared to defy the Shoguns honorable
blade testers.

01:08:15.270 --> 01:08:19.250
He then commands his two underlings to cut
off the enemies escape routes and slaughter

01:08:19.250 --> 01:08:20.469
them all.

01:08:20.469 --> 01:08:24.819
At the floodgates, Rien encounters this so
called wannabe Gabimaru and is surprised that

01:08:24.819 --> 01:08:26.799
he couldn't detect their presence at all.

01:08:26.799 --> 01:08:31.470
Gabi’s stalker says that they have no desire
to fight with Rien and is sure that if they

01:08:31.470 --> 01:08:35.120
just waited here, Gabimaru himself might come
to the floodgates.

01:08:35.120 --> 01:08:39.449
While asking if this person happens to be
from the mainland, Rien also commands the

01:08:39.449 --> 01:08:44.469
Dōshi to take them out, however, the second
Gabimaru just like he also did with Sagiri

01:08:44.469 --> 01:08:46.740
asks if they’d like to see some Ninjutsu?

01:08:46.740 --> 01:08:50.569
before suddenly using Ninpō: Ascetic Blaze
to incinerate the Dōshi.

01:08:50.569 --> 01:08:54.299
With the area around them beginning to catch
fire, the Ninja orders its clansmen to burn

01:08:54.299 --> 01:08:58.560
all the ships except for one while they themselves
take on Rien.

01:08:58.560 --> 01:09:03.900
Back inside of the Rentan sanctum Sagiri and
Mei are confronted by the Dōshi and Iwa Ninja.

01:09:03.900 --> 01:09:07.989
Sagiri sees the ninjas charging towards her
and instantly defends herself by sensing their

01:09:07.989 --> 01:09:10.150
Tao to track the flow of their movements.

01:09:10.150 --> 01:09:13.820
While fighting off everyone, she notices that
the Dōshi don't attack Mei while the shinobi

01:09:13.820 --> 01:09:16.900
do not attack her because of her position
in the clan.

01:09:16.900 --> 01:09:20.429
Believing that its most likely due to the
specific orders each side was given, she comes

01:09:20.429 --> 01:09:24.270
to the conclusion that the key to winning
lies in exploiting this weirdity.

01:09:24.270 --> 01:09:29.109
Two Dōshi then come charging in to attack,
however, ayoooo its time, they are randomly

01:09:29.109 --> 01:09:32.009
pulled away from the two by a random sticky
string.

01:09:32.009 --> 01:09:36.690
Ofcourse its no one other that the snnneeeaky
kunoichi herself, Yuzuriha.

01:09:36.690 --> 01:09:42.239
Seeing that her friend is still somehow alive
after her previous bout she runs in and gives

01:09:42.239 --> 01:09:43.280
her a hug.

01:09:43.280 --> 01:09:48.089
Pretty much we all got hard baited thinking
she’d passed away, when in all reality she

01:09:48.089 --> 01:10:00.610
just had 

01:10:00.610 --> 01:10:03.780
to rest.

01:10:03.780 --> 01:10:07.679
Noticing one random ninja, Yuzuriha then finishes
off a small group of them and explains to

01:10:07.679 --> 01:10:11.440
Sagiri that before meeting up with them she
checked out the surrounding area’s.

01:10:11.440 --> 01:10:15.250
The situation is probably the worst one they
could be in, right now they are seemingly

01:10:15.250 --> 01:10:18.290
cornered by all of the battles happening around
them.

01:10:18.290 --> 01:10:21.920
Since the shinobi were hired by the shogun,
Sagiri thinks that they could persuade them

01:10:21.920 --> 01:10:26.830
to fight together, however, Yuzuriha tells
her that it just wasnt possible since they

01:10:26.830 --> 01:10:30.840
are out to kill all of the criminals and reminds
Sagiri that their task for coming here has

01:10:30.840 --> 01:10:31.850
not changed.

01:10:31.850 --> 01:10:35.560
Sagiri knows this and points out that the
elixir is most likely at the floodgates.

01:10:35.560 --> 01:10:36.560
Turning she asks if Mei was willing to accompany
them to confront Rien, but before she even

01:10:36.560 --> 01:10:37.560
has the time to answer, the three are approached
by Isuzu.

01:10:37.560 --> 01:10:40.480
Seeing Sagiri for the first time since arriving
on the island Isuzu becomes relieved, but

01:10:40.480 --> 01:10:43.870
is shocked to see her standing next to the
criminal Yuzuriha of Keishu.

01:10:43.870 --> 01:10:48.440
Sagiri tries to explain that she and the other
executioners had no other choice but to team

01:10:48.440 --> 01:10:50.270
up with the criminals given their situation,
however, Isuzu pulls out a book and reads

01:10:50.270 --> 01:10:51.270
Yuzuriha's criminal records.

01:10:51.270 --> 01:10:54.699
She tells her that many lives were stolen
by her hands, so think of her victims, do

01:10:54.699 --> 01:10:58.250
not dishonor them as Yuzuriha is truly a villan.

01:10:58.250 --> 01:11:03.130
At the same time, Kiyomaru confronts Shion
and Nurugai while Jikka confronts Chōbei

01:11:03.130 --> 01:11:04.130
and Tōma.

01:11:04.130 --> 01:11:07.620
Isuzu explains in combination with the others
that each criminal and immortal creature are

01:11:07.620 --> 01:11:12.000
their enemies and anyone who is willing to
help them, even the Asaemon, are also seen

01:11:12.000 --> 01:11:13.020
as an enemy.

01:11:13.020 --> 01:11:18.480
With that said, Isuzu asks that Sagiri move
away from Yuzuriha and come join her side.

01:11:18.480 --> 01:11:22.679
Meanwhile, Gantetsusai and Fuchi who’d temporarily
separated themselves from the Aza Brothers

01:11:22.679 --> 01:11:25.360
run off in an attempt to find an escape route.

01:11:25.360 --> 01:11:29.199
Catching their attention though and slowly
appearing through shadows behind them.

01:11:29.199 --> 01:11:35.190
Oml Shugen looks rizzed out of his freaking
mind here, like the fit is darth mall spec.

01:11:35.190 --> 01:11:39.620
Standing there infront of them, Gantetsusai
notices just how menacing this dude is.

01:11:39.620 --> 01:11:43.480
Realizing that Fuchi has untied his criminal's
hands, Shugen angrily demands he give him

01:11:43.480 --> 01:11:45.530
a proper reasoning as to why.

01:11:45.530 --> 01:11:50.190
Wondering what's up with this uptight weirdo,
Gantetsusai tries doing a similar thing like

01:11:50.190 --> 01:11:56.550
he did with Gabi to feel out how his opponent
might fight, however, Shugen, sees through

01:11:56.550 --> 01:12:01.270
his intentions and silences his him, telling
Gantetsusai that he only wishes to speak with

01:12:01.270 --> 01:12:02.270
Fuchi.

01:12:02.270 --> 01:12:06.210
Gantetsusai just stands there dumbfounded
as to who Shugen is since, unlike the other

01:12:06.210 --> 01:12:11.050
opponents he has faced, he is unable to get
an exact read on what he’s packing.

01:12:11.050 --> 01:12:15.980
Shugen still not over his first question yells
out to Fuchi to explain the reason why his

01:12:15.980 --> 01:12:17.290
criminal's hands are untied.

01:12:17.290 --> 01:12:21.440
Like we all know from everything thats happened
on the island so far, Fuchi tries telling

01:12:21.440 --> 01:12:25.550
him that they had no other choice but to ally
themselves with the criminals due to the extreme

01:12:25.550 --> 01:12:26.989
circumstances.

01:12:26.989 --> 01:12:30.930
Shugen hears his reason but as he’s here
now, tells him that he no longer has to be

01:12:30.930 --> 01:12:34.000
by Gantetsusai's side and can behead him instead.

01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:37.980
He pleads with Fuchi to not throw away all
of the memories they have together, all the

01:12:37.980 --> 01:12:41.760
times they spoke about anatomy and the path
that he has chosen in life.

01:12:41.760 --> 01:12:46.080
Saddened with the reality of the situation,
Fuchi says that he also cherishes the times

01:12:46.080 --> 01:12:51.969
he spent learning about life through his experimentations,
but also says that before coming to this island

01:12:51.969 --> 01:12:56.790
he didnt understand the value of life, no,
not until the death of his close friend.

01:12:56.790 --> 01:13:00.699
He instead draws his sword and apologizes
for disappointing him but what they need to

01:13:00.699 --> 01:13:04.580
do now is focus on escaping, they can worry
about everything else later.

01:13:04.580 --> 01:13:09.740
After drawing out his sword, Shugen is shocked
to see that Fuchi used his tsuba as Gantetsusai's

01:13:09.740 --> 01:13:10.740
eyepatch.

01:13:10.740 --> 01:13:17.469
To him and most other Samurai the blade is
a warriors soul, the Yamada’s soul.

01:13:17.469 --> 01:13:21.820
Furious he screams that if he’s indeed misplaced
his soul then he’ll be forced to, but before

01:13:21.820 --> 01:13:26.880
he can even finish his sentence man is cut
off by the BIG G who himself became dissatisfied

01:13:26.880 --> 01:13:30.600
at the fact that Shugen just assumed he could
merc him with ease.

01:13:30.600 --> 01:13:34.160
Instantly the two clash swords and while stuck
in the blade tussle Tamiya knows that he’s

01:13:34.160 --> 01:13:36.890
fine and should be able to throw him around
with the size advantage.

01:13:36.890 --> 01:13:41.380
Winning the tussle like he though, Gantetsusai
manages to knock Shugen off his feet, however

01:13:41.380 --> 01:13:45.550
as he think’s he can take advantage of this
scenario, notices that the Samurai had legitimately

01:13:45.550 --> 01:13:48.070
transformed into someone else.

01:13:48.070 --> 01:13:52.120
Having gained some distance, big G instantly
closes it and goes to strike down on him but

01:13:52.120 --> 01:13:56.199
Shugen easily blocks Gantetsusai's next attack
and takes the time to tell him about the fond

01:13:56.199 --> 01:13:59.920
memories he had helping Yamada Asaemon Genji
with his calligraphy.

01:13:59.920 --> 01:14:03.800
As he starts to describe Genji, Shugen’s
strength increases and causes Gantetsusai

01:14:03.800 --> 01:14:06.760
to see him as an image of Genji.

01:14:06.760 --> 01:14:10.730
Shugen now with this massive strength buff
deflects Gantetsusai's attack and challenges

01:14:10.730 --> 01:14:11.730
him.

01:14:11.730 --> 01:14:16.310
With all of the fallen and even alive Yamada
beginning to appear as spirits behind him,

01:14:16.310 --> 01:14:20.219
Shugen states that it will not be him who
delivers the final blow, but the blades of

01:14:20.219 --> 01:14:22.360
all Yamada Asaemon.

01:14:22.360 --> 01:14:26.340
As the bout begins, Shugen uses Genji’s
Helm-Splitter technique to completely off

01:14:26.340 --> 01:14:30.570
balance Gantetsusai who is unable to counter
before the Samurai disarms him.

01:14:30.570 --> 01:14:34.210
Having lost his sword and with no other option
left, Gantetsusai tries to throw a punch,

01:14:34.210 --> 01:14:37.770
but Shugen once again avoids the attack by
imitating Kishō's ability.

01:14:37.770 --> 01:14:41.810
With the big guy beginning to fall over Shugen
explains the kind of man that Kishō was.

01:14:41.810 --> 01:14:46.280
Though he rarely asserted himself into a conversation,
he was a genius when it came to foreseeing

01:14:46.280 --> 01:14:47.550
and warding off attacks.

01:14:47.550 --> 01:14:50.970
Stepping things up a notch, Shion suddenly
uses a combination of both Kisho’s harvest

01:14:50.970 --> 01:14:55.239
shower and Genji’s Helm Divest in an attempt
to mortally wound the criminal.

01:14:55.239 --> 01:14:58.800
Dropping to his knee’s, Gantetsusai says
that he wished he go to play some more, but

01:14:58.800 --> 01:15:01.340
now he’s slowly starting to fade.

01:15:01.340 --> 01:15:06.530
Not taking him entirely seriously, Shion screams
that mercy isn't meant for the likes of a

01:15:06.530 --> 01:15:07.710
criminal, no.

01:15:07.710 --> 01:15:09.449
This is an execution.

01:15:09.449 --> 01:15:14.210
Having swung the blade down atop big G, Shugen
is left mortified to find that no one other

01:15:14.210 --> 01:15:17.240
than Fuchi has blocked his strike.

01:15:17.240 --> 01:15:21.590
Fuchi tries explaining that crime and evil
are not the same, Gantetsusai is a undoubtedly

01:15:21.590 --> 01:15:24.060
a criminal, but by no means is he "evil".

01:15:24.060 --> 01:15:28.199
He tells him that he’s just over this who
thing, he doesn't want anyone else to pass

01:15:28.199 --> 01:15:32.090
on, even if it means turning his back on the
laws of this era.

01:15:32.090 --> 01:15:35.510
Having heard these words, Shugen sees that
Fuchi hasn't changed since the time they first

01:15:35.510 --> 01:15:36.510
met.

01:15:36.510 --> 01:15:47.060
Ahh so yeah id love to go over what they got
up to just here, best buds but ya know YouTube

01:15:47.060 --> 01:15:48.060
n all these days.

01:15:48.060 --> 01:15:51.949
Annnyways, as we bang it back to reality Shugen
suddenly slashes Fuchi before he even has

01:15:51.949 --> 01:15:53.640
a chance to react.

01:15:53.640 --> 01:15:57.389
With tears beginning to fall from his face,
Shugen just remarks that he was a sublime

01:15:57.389 --> 01:16:02.340
man to the end, someone who only ever put
those infront of himself.

01:16:02.340 --> 01:16:07.000
Elsewhere inside the Rentan Temple, Isuzu
explains to Sagiri that she has faith in Shugen

01:16:07.000 --> 01:16:08.130
because he upholds order.

01:16:08.130 --> 01:16:13.130
He protects people who abide by the law and
punishes those who go against them, the level

01:16:13.130 --> 01:16:18.110
of crime doesn't matter, in his eyes its the
standard itself that needs to be upheld.

01:16:18.110 --> 01:16:22.880
At the same time, Chōbei and Tōma surrender,
Shion lays down his weapon, and Gabimaru is

01:16:22.880 --> 01:16:27.719
approached by two ninja with faces resembling
the Iwagakure chief and his wife.

01:16:27.719 --> 01:16:32.530
Back with the fallen Fuchi, Gantetsusai thinks
that its mental he’d ever go that far for

01:16:32.530 --> 01:16:33.800
the sake of order.

01:16:33.800 --> 01:16:38.380
Absolutely raging out at this point, Shugen
screams that no, this isn't crazy, what he

01:16:38.380 --> 01:16:42.949
witnessed was pure determination from which
there is no return and for that reason he

01:16:42.949 --> 01:16:48.780
condemns Tamiya a villan before seemingly
finishing it all.

01:16:48.780 --> 01:16:53.030
Manipulating the flames themselves, Rien controls
the second Gabimaru's fire ninjutsu and uses

01:16:53.030 --> 01:16:56.400
it against the surrounding ninja taking out
a bunch of them before they even got a chance

01:16:56.400 --> 01:16:57.400
to react.

01:16:57.400 --> 01:17:01.050
Dodging out of the blast herself, the female
Gabi throws a kunai at Rien which connects

01:17:01.050 --> 01:17:05.219
directly with the immortals face, but after
it recovers immediately sees that not only

01:17:05.219 --> 01:17:08.250
can the being use "sorcery" but is also able
to regenerate.

01:17:08.250 --> 01:17:13.030
Thinking back to what Gabimaru said about
how no matter what the situation, an enemy

01:17:13.030 --> 01:17:17.969
is still a physical being, if it has a conscious
mind then a strategy can be formed.

01:17:17.969 --> 01:17:22.050
With that in mind the second Gabimaru places
out her hands onto the shoulders of some ninja

01:17:22.050 --> 01:17:24.980
and commands them to use the last of their
life to set the ships ablaze.

01:17:24.980 --> 01:17:28.950
Not wanting the ships to burn up otherwise
all the butterflies and the whole plan goes

01:17:28.950 --> 01:17:32.489
up in flames, Rien tries to manipulate Tao
in an attempt to crush the ninja boarding

01:17:32.489 --> 01:17:33.570
the ships.

01:17:33.570 --> 01:17:37.260
Unable to stop everyone and seeing just how
tense Rien had become, the second Gabimaru

01:17:37.260 --> 01:17:39.350
calls out that she found her love.

01:17:39.350 --> 01:17:43.440
To her its obvious that she’s been holding
back as to not damage the surroundings, but

01:17:43.440 --> 01:17:47.699
in reality its only the ships that cause Rien
true pain.

01:17:47.699 --> 01:17:51.820
Pondering if its a possible love, the ninja
states that at times it can be troublesome

01:17:51.820 --> 01:17:56.639
and at others a strength, but in this fight
here it is indeed the immortals weakness.

01:17:56.639 --> 01:18:00.420
All of the surrounding Ninja which seemingly
keep appearing from the cracks like insects,

01:18:00.420 --> 01:18:02.670
send a plethora shuriken towards the creature.

01:18:02.670 --> 01:18:06.901
Rien easily blocks off the basic attack, but
is shocked to see that the Elixir of Life

01:18:06.901 --> 01:18:11.590
has been taken from her by the second Gabimaru
who without a second thought tosses it to

01:18:11.590 --> 01:18:13.969
another ninja and commands them to get it
outside.

01:18:13.969 --> 01:18:18.440
As Rien tries to stop them, the second Gabimaru
activates Ninpo; Pyro Bridge to launch a torrent

01:18:18.440 --> 01:18:20.800
of fire that completely engulfs the immortal.

01:18:20.800 --> 01:18:25.010
Rien doesn't drop their concentration over
which ninja has the elixir and destroys them

01:18:25.010 --> 01:18:26.010
with a shot of Tao.

01:18:26.010 --> 01:18:29.880
However it soon comes to their attention that
one of the items they were carrying was the

01:18:29.880 --> 01:18:33.780
squad leader's mask and the other with the
elixir escaped.

01:18:33.780 --> 01:18:37.510
The female Gabi knows that she stands no chance
of winning when it comes to strength, but

01:18:37.510 --> 01:18:38.510
this is war.

01:18:38.510 --> 01:18:42.070
When someone is in an unfavorable condition
one must exploit the enemy's point of view

01:18:42.070 --> 01:18:47.760
to create chaos, that way any outcome is possible
as in war it isn't the strong who prevail,

01:18:47.760 --> 01:18:49.610
its the wicked and twisted.

01:18:49.610 --> 01:18:53.650
After bringing the elixir outside, the shinobi
pulls out a massive sea shell and signals

01:18:53.650 --> 01:18:55.630
the team that it has been acquired.

01:18:55.630 --> 01:18:59.739
Isuzu hears the signals indicating to her
that the mission is now complete.

01:18:59.739 --> 01:19:03.590
Yuzuriha who’s on the ground infront of
her unable deal massive damage due to still

01:19:03.590 --> 01:19:07.360
needing to heal attempts to fight against
Isuzu without her full power.

01:19:07.360 --> 01:19:11.969
Seeing the slimy string coming Isuzu easily
counters by kicking rubble up from the ground

01:19:11.969 --> 01:19:12.969
below.

01:19:12.969 --> 01:19:16.800
Sagiri quickly darts in and gets Yuzuriha
out of the way while asking her fellow executioner

01:19:16.800 --> 01:19:19.830
to calm down as Yuzuriha is not the villain.

01:19:19.830 --> 01:19:24.320
Utterly enraged by the fact that Sagiri just
wont listen, Isuzu responds by telling her

01:19:24.320 --> 01:19:28.070
that even though they captured the elixir
she will not stand to see any of the criminals

01:19:28.070 --> 01:19:30.070
alive before they leave.

01:19:30.070 --> 01:19:34.300
Going into a small flashback, it shows that
even tho Isuzu didnt exactly have a bond with

01:19:34.300 --> 01:19:38.510
everyone inside of the dojo she felt a connection
with Sagiri the first met since they were

01:19:38.510 --> 01:19:42.780
females in the Yamada clan, so now to see
her teamed up with an enemy on the island

01:19:42.780 --> 01:19:44.870
it makes her enraged.

01:19:44.870 --> 01:19:49.570
Meanwhile, Gabimaru watches as the two shinobi,
Kinkakubō and Ginkakubō, use Transformation

01:19:49.570 --> 01:19:53.920
Jutsu to reform their faces into the Iwagakure
chief and his wife.

01:19:53.920 --> 01:19:57.840
Speaking as the chief he tells Gabimaru that
he has been expelled from the clan, no grave

01:19:57.840 --> 01:20:02.030
shall bear his name as to leave the village
means that you no longer exist in reality.

01:20:02.030 --> 01:20:06.219
Speaking of reality the same goes for his
wife, as apparently she is only an illusion

01:20:06.219 --> 01:20:11.260
created as a scheme to help imprison his heart
inside of the clan, however it sadly backfired

01:20:11.260 --> 01:20:12.370
in his case.

01:20:12.370 --> 01:20:16.840
Funnily enough Gabimaru complements the two
Ninja on their adept use of transformation

01:20:16.840 --> 01:20:20.901
Jutsu and hearing him do so makes the big
guy shudder with joy over the fact the revered

01:20:20.901 --> 01:20:22.340
Gabimaru would say so.

01:20:22.340 --> 01:20:26.090
Hearing the two talk to him about the next
Gabi’s instructions, our boy easily figures

01:20:26.090 --> 01:20:30.210
that the next Gabimaru must be Shija, which
the two confirmed.

01:20:30.210 --> 01:20:34.060
Along with this they also updated their previous
commander that Kumokiri, along with two others

01:20:34.060 --> 01:20:35.870
had perished on the voyage to the island.

01:20:35.870 --> 01:20:40.199
They also insisted on telling Gabimaru that
Shija was obviously the person who merced

01:20:40.199 --> 01:20:45.110
all the other candidates and that in their
eyes they still view him as the true Gabimaru.

01:20:45.110 --> 01:20:49.610
Finally I can let me brain rest and just refer
to the female Gabi as Shija now, holy the

01:20:49.610 --> 01:20:52.469
idea her name wasn't mentioned until now blew
my mind when I re-read this.

01:20:52.469 --> 01:20:53.469
Gabimaru then asks them to explain the real
reason behind why the clan was hired for this

01:20:53.469 --> 01:20:55.300
mission, however, Kinkakubō responds saying
that the chief just works in mysterious ways.

01:20:55.300 --> 01:20:58.909
After they also hear the massive trumpet go
off the guys let Gabi know that it informs

01:20:58.909 --> 01:21:00.920
them that they’ve acquired the Elixir of
Life.

01:21:00.920 --> 01:21:06.800
Then moving onto the main issue at hand, Kinkakubō
humbly asks Gabimaru to end his life as this

01:21:06.800 --> 01:21:11.300
way the chief will remove the kill order on
him and if he wants to can make it painless

01:21:11.300 --> 01:21:13.929
by licking the ninja’s toxic saliva.

01:21:13.929 --> 01:21:19.100
Gabimaru found their method to be gross but
is begged by Kinkakubō to reconsider since

01:21:19.100 --> 01:21:21.330
in their hearts they’re all allies.

01:21:21.330 --> 01:21:24.949
Pointing out that they hadn't entered his
throwing hands range, Gabi praises them for

01:21:24.949 --> 01:21:27.500
following the basic ninja principles.

01:21:27.500 --> 01:21:31.969
Despite this Gabimaru flexes his bloodlust
and causes them to stumble backwards.

01:21:31.969 --> 01:21:35.910
Somewhat annoyed Kinkakubō asked if he was
still willing to defy the chief and hearing

01:21:35.910 --> 01:21:38.310
that Gabimaru planned to escape this place.

01:21:38.310 --> 01:21:43.370
Kinkakubō tells him that even if he does
make it back to Japan, Yui does not exist.

01:21:43.370 --> 01:21:46.500
Obviously our boys heard this bot ass take
how many times now?

01:21:46.500 --> 01:21:50.449
Man just cant fathom the idea that she isn't
alive, especially since he knows the people

01:21:50.449 --> 01:21:55.219
from Iwa specialize in psychological warfare,
so in his eyes he has to see it to believe

01:21:55.219 --> 01:21:56.219
it.

01:21:56.219 --> 01:22:00.580
Although they were unable to reason with him
and much to the annoyance of Gabimaru, Kinkakubō

01:22:00.580 --> 01:22:04.950
says that he and the others are all delighted
that he refused since this gives them a chance

01:22:04.950 --> 01:22:08.719
to fight to the death with the current Gabimaru
Iwagakure.

01:22:08.719 --> 01:22:13.560
Everyone inside of Iwagakure looks up to him,
especially the younglings, the idea that they

01:22:13.560 --> 01:22:16.330
all get to fight in mortal combat with him
is a dream.

01:22:16.330 --> 01:22:19.810
Funnily enough some of the higher ranks even
dropped down to get the opportunity to become

01:22:19.810 --> 01:22:23.810
fodder on this mission, JUST so they had the
chance to throw hands with Gabi.

01:22:23.810 --> 01:22:28.460
Bowing their heads in honor of what's about
to come, the plethora of Genin rush towards

01:22:28.460 --> 01:22:35.330
Gabimaru, However, using Tao sensation and
looking like he perceives everything in reality,

01:22:35.330 --> 01:22:38.840
Gabimaru quickly deals with the ninja, dodging
in and out of all of their attacks and using

01:22:38.840 --> 01:22:40.400
their own weapons against them.

01:22:40.400 --> 01:22:44.830
With the fodder losers dealt with, Gabi tells
them all that Iwagakure's tactics such as

01:22:44.830 --> 01:22:48.510
