She knows that she swore not to defile her
brothers legacy by working with these criminals

01:35:36.380 --> 01:35:40.380
so instead she decides to defer and catch
up with Shugen.

01:35:40.380 --> 01:35:45.330
With everyone onboard, Jikka prepares to discuss
the plan but wishes for Shion to explain instead,

01:35:45.330 --> 01:35:46.800
much to his annoyance.

01:35:46.800 --> 01:35:51.239
While Gabimaru is seemingly distracted, the
Iwagakure shinobi ready themselves while remembering

01:35:51.239 --> 01:35:56.010
a specific shinobi principle: When going for
the kill, keep your presence suppressed, no

01:35:56.010 --> 01:35:59.760
movements, let it all come as naturally as
breathing.

01:35:59.760 --> 01:36:03.250
As if nothing is out of the ordinary they
all take the opportunity to attack him with

01:36:03.250 --> 01:36:04.270
thrown kunai.

01:36:04.270 --> 01:36:09.060
In the moments before they striked from the
shadows, Shion explained to the unaware group

01:36:09.060 --> 01:36:13.830
that a tanden can only be destroyed by a user
with the correct Tao attribute, and Tao Restoration

01:36:13.830 --> 01:36:15.550
will increase the attack potency.

01:36:15.550 --> 01:36:25.489
Mei then confirms the Tao attributes of Jikka
who’s earth, Kiyomaru with metal, and Isuzu

01:36:25.489 --> 01:36:26.720
with water Tao.

01:36:26.720 --> 01:36:31.400
Wondering if the scruffy dude is anyone you
can count on, Yuzuriha questions Sagiri about

01:36:31.400 --> 01:36:35.699
his skill, to which she also becomes unsure
due to the bad rumors about him.

01:36:35.699 --> 01:36:40.450
These bad rumors btw are like that he pawned
his blade so the one he has now is trash and

01:36:40.450 --> 01:36:44.110
often gets on the booze with the boys not
completing assignments.

01:36:44.110 --> 01:36:47.940
While they are distracted, the Iwagakure shinobi
throw their kunai at Gabimaru in an attempt

01:36:47.940 --> 01:36:49.560
to finish their mission.

01:36:49.560 --> 01:36:53.401
Randomly though, Jikka notices their attack
and turns asking if they really wanna go through

01:36:53.401 --> 01:36:54.401
with this.

01:36:54.401 --> 01:36:59.610
So you see even Sagiri has been confused for
a while as to why Jikka is rank 3 and even

01:36:59.610 --> 01:37:01.260
asked Shion back in the day.

01:37:01.260 --> 01:37:05.460
Shion states that taking his personality into
account he’s the lowest of low, it was confirmed

01:37:05.460 --> 01:37:10.380
that he sold his sword for some cash and now
only carries around a simple bamboo takemitsu

01:37:10.380 --> 01:37:14.489
which is a sign of disrespect to the Shogun,
however he’s never once been accused of

01:37:14.489 --> 01:37:16.920
it, due to how his blade cuts like steel.

01:37:16.920 --> 01:37:20.489
Shion explains that one time while they were
on the booze he told him he could perceive

01:37:20.489 --> 01:37:25.889
the truth in all things and through that manipulate
someone's momentum by applying force in certain

01:37:25.889 --> 01:37:26.889
spots.

01:37:26.889 --> 01:37:29.900
He claimed that it was something that went
beyond just the waves Shion was able to perceive

01:37:29.900 --> 01:37:34.590
and in reality its fairly evident mans aligned
himself with some yin or yang as he was able

01:37:34.590 --> 01:37:38.590
to easily reflect all of the Kunai back into
the Ninja.

01:37:38.590 --> 01:37:43.239
Takemitsu btw refers to like a bamboo sword
carved in the shape of a Katana.

01:37:43.239 --> 01:37:46.840
Its not the Shinai which is made up of bundled
slats or a bokken which is usually made of

01:37:46.840 --> 01:37:49.469
heavier wood and sometimes referred to as
a bokuto.

01:37:49.469 --> 01:37:58.280
The word Takemitsu can also be used as a pejorative
for a cheap, dull-edged blade.

01:37:58.280 --> 01:38:02.260
With everyone stunned at what just happened,
Nurugai becomes confused because she thought

01:38:02.260 --> 01:38:05.949
the shinobi were on their side but is told
by Jikka that he knew the shinobi were only

01:38:05.949 --> 01:38:09.800
pretending to be allies to complete their
main objective of taking out Gabi.

01:38:09.800 --> 01:38:14.510
Jikka confesses that he did not know whether
to side with Iwagakure or Gabimaru but after

01:38:14.510 --> 01:38:19.219
seeing Gabi decided to stick with him thinking
that they were somewhat alike, although Gabimaru

01:38:19.219 --> 01:38:20.219
disagrees.

01:38:20.219 --> 01:38:25.780
Ya see Jikka tho he got a few ladies' n thats
why he thinks they’re similar.

01:38:25.780 --> 01:38:29.659
Yuzuriha becomes convinced of Jikka's abilities
but still finds herself unable to get a good

01:38:29.659 --> 01:38:30.900
read on him.

01:38:30.900 --> 01:38:33.650
The group then decides to take possession
of the shinobi's equipment.

01:38:33.650 --> 01:38:38.639
Sagiri finds herself conflicted, thinking
they have to start over with their harsh situation,

01:38:38.639 --> 01:38:41.989
and knowing that even if they succeed they’re
all doomed to slaughter each other at the

01:38:41.989 --> 01:38:43.050
end.

01:38:43.050 --> 01:38:46.360
Gabimaru disagrees though as he believes there
are a few differences compared to how they

01:38:46.360 --> 01:38:50.400
started and while looking at just how much
everyone has changed, Yuzuriha agree’s with

01:38:50.400 --> 01:38:54.800
this illogical thinking of his, as thats when
he tends to be right.

01:38:54.800 --> 01:38:59.780
And DAAAAMN everyone looks to fire with the
new fits, especially Chōbei dude looks so

01:38:59.780 --> 01:39:01.159
demonic.

01:39:01.159 --> 01:39:06.719
So everyone's’ pairings have pretty much
stayed the same, except this time instead

01:39:06.719 --> 01:39:11.969
of being with Yuzuriha, Gabi is with Sagiri
since her wood Tao will help his fire, Yuzuriha

01:39:11.969 --> 01:39:15.970
will stay with Mei to figure out the exact
locations of each Tanden and finally big G

01:39:15.970 --> 01:39:19.400
will team up with Jikka to help boost his
earth Tao.

01:39:19.400 --> 01:39:24.310
everyone well equipped and paired up, the
group sets off to destroy the tandens.

01:39:24.310 --> 01:39:29.150
Falling into a memory of the Tensen, Zhu Jin
remembers Rien's explanation on the Rite of

01:39:29.150 --> 01:39:31.989
Just Consumption and giggles at his poor drawings.

01:39:31.989 --> 01:39:36.590
Ju Fa notices their smirk and reprimands them,
to which the youngling apologizes but remarks

01:39:36.590 --> 01:39:39.220
that the cant stand the way Ju Fa picks on
them.

01:39:39.220 --> 01:39:43.139
The Tensen knows that its all for Tao Fa’s
sake but finds it annoying he’s always on

01:39:43.139 --> 01:39:44.699
edge trying to protect them.

01:39:44.699 --> 01:39:49.030
Thinking on each Tensen more, Zhu Jin goes
over all of the good and bad qualities of

01:39:49.030 --> 01:39:52.190
them and how at heart they’re truly nice
people.

01:39:52.190 --> 01:39:56.239
Then remembering how they must work hard so
they don't fail like last time, large white

01:39:56.239 --> 01:39:59.980
orbs begin appearing infront of her making
her think she needs to collect them all to

01:39:59.980 --> 01:40:02.179
complete the Rite of Just Consumption.

01:40:02.179 --> 01:40:06.690
In reality the amalgamation of Zhu Jin's Banko
begins grabbing at the surroundings doing

01:40:06.690 --> 01:40:09.639
its best to gather as many different types
of Tao.

01:40:09.639 --> 01:40:13.780
Having made their way to the Shu'itsu Temple,
Kiyo and Isuzu comfortably destroy a bunch

01:40:13.780 --> 01:40:16.139
of random creatures protecting the entrance.

01:40:16.139 --> 01:40:20.020
Isuzu starts to notice that she is getting
exhausted from staying too long in the area

01:40:20.020 --> 01:40:23.060
and finally realizes that this is why they
had to ally with criminals.

01:40:23.060 --> 01:40:27.860
Hearing her statement and while taking out
a few insects, Kiyomaru tells Isuzu to not

01:40:27.860 --> 01:40:31.690
doubt Shugen's orders as he was the only one
who ever believed in them.

01:40:31.690 --> 01:40:35.139
Shugen never judged them for coming from an
offshoot dojo or because they were young,

01:40:35.139 --> 01:40:37.730
he trained everyone the same no matter what.

01:40:37.730 --> 01:40:41.560
After remembering the respect Shugen showed
him, Kiyomaru reminds her of how he stood

01:40:41.560 --> 01:40:45.060
up for her in the past and was even the person
who got her the teaching role.

01:40:45.060 --> 01:40:49.070
Isuzu thanks Kiyomaru for reminding her about
her loyalty towards Shugen and remembers the

01:40:49.070 --> 01:40:52.590
time Shugen pointed out the beauty in the
color of her skin.

01:40:52.590 --> 01:40:56.710
Having cut their way through the overgrowth
outside the Palace, Isuzu breaks the door

01:40:56.710 --> 01:41:00.130
open, rushes in and tells herself that Shugen
is in the right.

01:41:00.130 --> 01:41:04.179
Standing there inside of the Shu'itsu Temple
the duo finally confront one of Zhu Jin's

01:41:04.179 --> 01:41:05.570
Tandens.

01:41:05.570 --> 01:41:09.780
After arriving at the Banko's Earth tanden,
Shion tells Nurugai to stay back as he defends

01:41:09.780 --> 01:41:12.830
against the monsters approaching them but
quickly realizes he’s nearing his limit.

01:41:12.830 --> 01:41:17.300
They then hear the sound of the conch from
Yuzuriha, signaling that everyone has reached

01:41:17.300 --> 01:41:19.800
their respective tandens and can begin to
destroy them.

01:41:19.800 --> 01:41:24.409
Seeing as how the tanden is too high up for
his sword to reach, Shion imbues Nurugai's

01:41:24.409 --> 01:41:28.170
sword with his strengthen Tao and throws it
towards the tanden but unfortunately it only

01:41:28.170 --> 01:41:29.599
leaves a shallow cut.

01:41:29.599 --> 01:41:33.610
In her own dark world, Zhu Jin feels something
attack her hand but cant seem to figure out

01:41:33.610 --> 01:41:34.889
what it is.

01:41:34.889 --> 01:41:38.989
Reaching forth trying to grab a ball of Tao,
its shown that in reality she's controlling

01:41:38.989 --> 01:41:41.060
monsters which are about to grab the duo.

01:41:41.060 --> 01:41:44.650
Shion yells out to Nurugai to stay behind
him until the next sound of the horn since

01:41:44.650 --> 01:41:47.409
her inability to use Tao puts her in danger.

01:41:47.409 --> 01:41:51.159
Wanting to speak up, Nurugai remembers all
of the times Shion told her to stay back as

01:41:51.159 --> 01:41:55.599
he fought alone and how he relinquished his
status as a Yamada Asaemon in front of Kiyomaru

01:41:55.599 --> 01:41:57.560
in order to become her guardian.

01:41:57.560 --> 01:42:02.780
He knows that due to the era he’s currently
in he has no hope of changing any of the laws

01:42:02.780 --> 01:42:03.780
around her fate.

01:42:03.780 --> 01:42:08.119
However a man can change himself and thats
why he decided to leave the Yamada clan, because

01:42:08.119 --> 01:42:12.750
like the legend he is, he couldn't condone
the execution of an innocent person.

01:42:12.750 --> 01:42:18.060
Nurugai asks Shion if he meant what he said
during that time, to which he answers yes.

01:42:18.060 --> 01:42:21.830
After saying that she was happy to hear him
state that, Nurugai rushes in to attack the

01:42:21.830 --> 01:42:22.830
monsters herself.

01:42:22.830 --> 01:42:26.159
She already knows that its dangerous, and
remembers the reason as to why she cannot

01:42:26.159 --> 01:42:27.520
perceive Tao.

01:42:27.520 --> 01:42:31.670
So ya see in her clan they don't believe things
that cant be seen or touched.

01:42:31.670 --> 01:42:35.110
However after thinking about what cant be
seen, and remembering the feelings she felt

01:42:35.110 --> 01:42:40.920
towards Tenza, manages to awaken this ability
and breaks forth into the reality of gods.

01:42:40.920 --> 01:42:44.730
Having cut down a bunch of fodder creatures
with this new technique, she tells Shion that

01:42:44.730 --> 01:42:48.710
she needs to use her own strength to survive
and asks that he become her partner instead

01:42:48.710 --> 01:42:49.940
of a guardian.

01:42:49.940 --> 01:42:54.320
With a smile on his face, Shion states that
his eyes have clearly deceived him and because

01:42:54.320 --> 01:42:57.960
his body cant take to much more, asks that
she take the lead until the next sound of

01:42:57.960 --> 01:42:59.349
the horn rings out.

01:42:59.349 --> 01:43:02.699
Agreeing, Nurugai rushes forth and takes the
lead.

01:43:02.699 --> 01:43:07.210
Still unable to see, Zhu Jin becomes furious
at the random damage she keeps taking and

01:43:07.210 --> 01:43:11.410
causes the Earth tanden to sprout multiple
bodies of Mu Dan, much to Shion and Nurugai's

01:43:11.410 --> 01:43:12.410
shock.

01:43:12.410 --> 01:43:16.100
While at the Wood tanden, Chōbei and Tōma
find themselves confronted by clones of Tao

01:43:16.100 --> 01:43:19.500
Fa that have emerged from the tanden, leading
them to believe that the same is happening

01:43:19.500 --> 01:43:23.930
to every tanden that corresponds with the
Tao attributes of that specific Tensen.

01:43:23.930 --> 01:43:27.350
The brothers then begin to ponder on whether
they should make the choice of escaping with

01:43:27.350 --> 01:43:31.260
the other survivors or act on Jikka's secret
plan of eliminating Shugen in order for him

01:43:31.260 --> 01:43:34.480
to make a false report to the shogun that
they had died.

01:43:34.480 --> 01:43:38.980
So i've held off sooo hard from saying this
earlier, but you see our friendly neighborhood

01:43:38.980 --> 01:43:43.159
Jikka is actually what id consider to be a
first generation Yakuza.

01:43:43.159 --> 01:43:46.590
We know for a fact that Samurai overtime did
indeed take that role throughout this period

01:43:46.590 --> 01:43:50.270
of Japan, as with no war, they took different
routes of occupation.

01:43:50.270 --> 01:43:54.489
Why he wants everyone gone is for the fact
man wants to be the next leader of the clan

01:43:54.489 --> 01:43:56.860
and doing that would be perfect for him.

01:43:56.860 --> 01:44:00.460
He wants to put this world behind him for
one of luxury instead, plus he also drops

01:44:00.460 --> 01:44:05.290
the bomb that if Shion and Sagiri end up surviving
the bandits can take them down if they please,

01:44:05.290 --> 01:44:07.730
but thats just a maybe.

01:44:07.730 --> 01:44:11.720
After the clones partially transform into
their Kishikai, Chōbei prepares to fight

01:44:11.720 --> 01:44:15.340
back but feels his body suffering from the
Banko's effects on his Tao.

01:44:15.340 --> 01:44:19.310
He also senses that Tōma is gradually suffering
from the Tao particles in the air and tries

01:44:19.310 --> 01:44:21.250
to think of a logical plan going forward.

01:44:21.250 --> 01:44:25.099
Chōbei knows that its pretty much impossible
to take on both the Tao Fa army and destroy

01:44:25.099 --> 01:44:28.739
the Tanden, plus they've got no time to do
the restore glitch effect.

01:44:28.739 --> 01:44:32.969
Telling himself to break apart once more he
knows that he just gotta do it, originally

01:44:32.969 --> 01:44:37.090
it was his plan to slam back the elixir with
his brother, but now he’s leaving everything

01:44:37.090 --> 01:44:40.530
up to him without a single worry at all as
he knows he’ll win.

01:44:40.530 --> 01:44:44.630
Watching his brother run ahead of him, Chōbei
pushes himself forth and forces vines out

01:44:44.630 --> 01:44:48.190
of his back, front and all sides that destroys
everything around him.

01:44:48.190 --> 01:44:52.199
Meanwhile, Gabimaru and Sagiri are approached
by Shija who has comfortably taken out all

01:44:52.199 --> 01:44:54.139
of the Gui Fa clones.

01:44:54.139 --> 01:44:58.849
Flashing back to the moment Gabimaru and Sagiri
confronted the Gui Fa clones, Shija comes

01:44:58.849 --> 01:45:00.820
in and quickly disposes of the clones.

01:45:00.820 --> 01:45:05.560
As the dust begins to fade its obvious that
she’s extremely delighted to reunite with

01:45:05.560 --> 01:45:06.560
Gabimaru.

01:45:06.560 --> 01:45:09.930
Gabimaru then takes the time to talk to Shija
due to knowing that the shinobi is unpredictable,

01:45:09.930 --> 01:45:14.230
however, after hearing the sound of the conch,
Sagiri reminds him that they are running out

01:45:14.230 --> 01:45:18.989
of time and must either have Shija cooperate
with them or take them on as an enemy.

01:45:18.989 --> 01:45:22.060
Gabimaru tells Sagiri that he cant afford
to fight Shija with the current state he’s

01:45:22.060 --> 01:45:24.989
in, prompting Sagiri to try to perform a Tao
Restoration on him.

01:45:24.989 --> 01:45:28.373
Seeing this and while calling her a wench,
Shija darts in behind the two and prepares

01:45:28.373 --> 01:45:32.949
to take out Sagiri, only to cease their assault
in an instant after being ordered by Gabimaru

01:45:32.949 --> 01:45:34.080
to wait.

01:45:34.080 --> 01:45:38.330
Hearing him out, Gabi just asks her to help
as he’s in great need of her strength.

01:45:38.330 --> 01:45:43.190
With Shija having multiple personalities its
hard to know which way she’ll react.

01:45:43.190 --> 01:45:45.909
Turns out shes been waiting for months to
hear those words.

01:45:45.909 --> 01:45:50.030
A battle in her mind between helping the chief
or following her heart.

01:45:50.030 --> 01:45:54.659
Happily she agrees to help Gabimaru but only
in order to truly resurrect his true self.

01:45:54.659 --> 01:45:59.340
In a sense, she will dedicate her existence
to the sole revival of histories strongest

01:45:59.340 --> 01:46:00.810
Gabimaru the Hollow.

01:46:00.810 --> 01:46:05.060
As Shija rushes in to attack and despite his
previous injuries Gabimaru tells Sagiri to

01:46:05.060 --> 01:46:09.650
take down the regenerated Gui Fa clones behind
them while he handles fighting against Shija.

01:46:09.650 --> 01:46:13.311
Shija first starts off their attack by using
Ninpo: Hair Forged to throw multiple hair

01:46:13.311 --> 01:46:14.311
kunai at Gabimaru.

01:46:14.311 --> 01:46:19.150
While dodging them, Shija uses the opening
to use Ninpo: Flash Hand to push him backwards.

01:46:19.150 --> 01:46:23.150
Gabimaru flashes out of the way of a kunai
and fights her in close quarters combat, with

01:46:23.150 --> 01:46:27.550
the two using a multitude of technical techniques
to try and get the upper hand on the other.

01:46:27.550 --> 01:46:31.239
Simultaneously the both of them end their
initial clash by using Ninpō: Fire Monk to

01:46:31.239 --> 01:46:33.300
create a massive explosion.

01:46:33.300 --> 01:46:37.170
Knowing that Shija knows more ninjutsu than
him, Gabimaru speculates that continuing to

01:46:37.170 --> 01:46:41.800
fight with Taijutsu is more effective, however,
Shija literally word for word quotes what

01:46:41.800 --> 01:46:46.360
Gabimaru was thinking and tells him that they
are aware of every move he makes as after

01:46:46.360 --> 01:46:49.570
all they spent so much time observing him.

01:46:49.570 --> 01:46:52.960
Despite this and as the two begin fighting
once more, Gabimaru tells Shija that they

01:46:52.960 --> 01:46:55.840
are also able to read their actions with the
help of Tao.

01:46:55.840 --> 01:46:59.010
He then purposefully takes a kick to the navel
in an attempt to send himself towards the

01:46:59.010 --> 01:47:03.599
Banko's tanden and destroy it but ends up
only destroying the statue beneath it.

01:47:03.599 --> 01:47:06.920
Shija sees through him and could tell that
from the very start of their fight he has

01:47:06.920 --> 01:47:10.610
been protecting Sagiri (who they refer to
as ‘the hag’).

01:47:10.610 --> 01:47:14.540
They then start to wonder if Gabimaru's current
state is because of the hags presence and

01:47:14.540 --> 01:47:18.429
as she manages to get the upper hand, slamming
Gabi into the ground, Shija becomes saddened

01:47:18.429 --> 01:47:22.930
after seeing that Gabimaru's body is suffering
from weakened Tao regeneration.

01:47:22.930 --> 01:47:26.590
Picking up his face and staring into his eyes,
she finds it truly heartbreaking to see that

01:47:26.590 --> 01:47:30.480
her love lost his deadly ferocity and instead
choose to protect others.

01:47:30.480 --> 01:47:35.220
Shija then realizes in anger that Sagiri is
with Gabimaru to perform Tao Restoration and

01:47:35.220 --> 01:47:37.199
jumps towards her direction in disgust.

01:47:37.199 --> 01:47:39.250
Gabimaru yells out to Sagiri to run.

01:47:39.250 --> 01:47:42.719
However, Sagiri refuses, stating that she’s
had enough, she wont stand being called a

01:47:42.719 --> 01:47:45.980
hag anymore and prepares to face Shija alone.

01:47:45.980 --> 01:47:49.930
Knowing that the ninja isn't an immortal,
Sagiri uses her Tao sensory to anticipate

01:47:49.930 --> 01:47:53.739
Shija's attack, but is unable to react in
time as in an instant she appears before her

01:47:53.739 --> 01:47:55.940
and slams her to the ground.

01:47:55.940 --> 01:47:59.869
Having picked up a special bag earlier, Sagiri
pulls it out causing the female ninja to quickly

01:47:59.869 --> 01:48:04.080
dart back and ask why she is allied with Gabimaru
despite her job.

01:48:04.080 --> 01:48:08.791
Sagiri explains that yes once apon a time
she lived to a strict code, but this is no

01:48:08.791 --> 01:48:13.730
longer the case, as an era begins to shift
its almost possible to sympathize with anyone,

01:48:13.730 --> 01:48:17.460
not just Gabimaru, but the Tensen's and even
Iwagakure ninja.

01:48:17.460 --> 01:48:21.310
After hearing this statement, Shija uses her
Ninpo: knotted locks, sending her hair through

01:48:21.310 --> 01:48:24.530
the ground, before it springs up restraining
Sagiri, pinning her down.

01:48:24.530 --> 01:48:28.840
Thinking that Sagiri wants to share a similar
experience to herself, she makes her inhale

01:48:28.840 --> 01:48:30.690
the powder she tossed earlier.

01:48:30.690 --> 01:48:34.781
So you see this powder is one that manipulates
ones sensations and makes them experience

01:48:34.781 --> 01:48:36.670
an overwhelming sensation of pain.

01:48:36.670 --> 01:48:41.450
Its often used in the training of young ninja,
which just like it shows with Shija, usually

01:48:41.450 --> 01:48:44.520
results in only a few of the family members
surviving.

01:48:44.520 --> 01:48:47.920
This toxin is known as nerve powder and all
in Iwagakure undergo intensive training with

01:48:47.920 --> 01:48:52.690
it for 3 days and 3 nights until they acclimate
to the pain.

01:48:52.690 --> 01:48:56.690
As they prepare to give Sagiri another drug
which is called never bliss and connects with

01:48:56.690 --> 01:49:01.860
the pleasure section of the brain, Shija tells
her that all in Iwagakure are made to be numb,

01:49:01.860 --> 01:49:06.410
stripped of their senses so that the only
feeling they have left is one of death.

01:49:06.410 --> 01:49:10.239
Fear and despair in the face of death are
the only distinct sensation those inside the

01:49:10.239 --> 01:49:11.420
clan feel.

01:49:11.420 --> 01:49:15.410
Gabimaru first granted her that feeling, and
through her encounter with him she eventually

01:49:15.410 --> 01:49:17.310
became aware of her own mortality.

01:49:17.310 --> 01:49:23.429
Yes in it there is death which embodies life
itself, death which comes for all, true fleeting

01:49:23.429 --> 01:49:26.610
life can only be found in that moment of parting.

01:49:26.610 --> 01:49:31.280
Ahh Yuki back at it with the poetry, had to
change things up slightly so its not suuuper

01:49:31.280 --> 01:49:37.360
morbid cause ya-know YouTube, but I recommend
everyone go read this for themselves as Yuki

01:49:37.360 --> 01:49:42.120
kinda pops off with just how beautifully he
constructs a vivid image with words themselves

01:49:42.120 --> 01:49:43.120
in someone's mind.

01:49:43.120 --> 01:49:44.120
Usually a mangaka’s most potent tool is
their art or pencil, but sometimes Yuki is

01:49:44.120 --> 01:49:45.120
just as great with the writing in my opinion.

01:49:45.120 --> 01:49:47.840
With his body suffering and his Tao depleted,
as well as Sagiri being unable to combat against

01:49:47.840 --> 01:49:52.180
Shija, Gabimaru see’s their chances of victory
slowly fade away.

01:49:52.180 --> 01:49:56.940
Shija asks Gabimaru why he is desperately
clinging to life, to which he answers that

01:49:56.940 --> 01:49:59.659
he desires to live a normal life with his
wife.

01:49:59.659 --> 01:50:03.610
Shija tells Gabimaru that his wish can not
come to pass since Iwagakure will remain in

01:50:03.610 --> 01:50:07.250
pursuit of him forever and his wife does not
exist.

01:50:07.250 --> 01:50:11.010
Gabimaru denies the thought though as he knows
its the typical psychological warfare and

01:50:11.010 --> 01:50:14.389
tries to buy time to recover his Tao and present
an opening for Sagiri.

01:50:14.389 --> 01:50:18.370
Shija like shes done throughout the majority
of this bout, sees through his scheme and

01:50:18.370 --> 01:50:21.910
pleads to Gabimaru to come to his senses as
they try to explain that his wife and the

01:50:21.910 --> 01:50:24.050
life he shared with her is false, pure make
believe...

01:50:24.050 --> 01:50:28.239
Back over at the main body of the Banko, Gantetsusai
focuses on preparing himself to cut down the

01:50:28.239 --> 01:50:29.820
giant flower in front of him.

01:50:29.820 --> 01:50:33.920
Meanwhile, Jikka who aint really that keen
to do much right now decides to lay down and

01:50:33.920 --> 01:50:36.409
puts his faith in Gantetsusai.

01:50:36.409 --> 01:50:40.929
Gantetsusai interprets his unfazed behavior
as a test of courage and sits down wishing

01:50:40.929 --> 01:50:44.530
to follow along as well, which Jikka found
to be strange.

01:50:44.530 --> 01:50:48.120
He then hears the signal to take action but
is told by Jikka that the roots will tell

01:50:48.120 --> 01:50:51.239
them when the tandens have been destroyed
and when its the correct time to take out

01:50:51.239 --> 01:50:52.449
the main plant.

01:50:52.449 --> 01:50:56.290
Gantetsusai questions how he knows this and
Jikka explains that he has been able to understand

01:50:56.290 --> 01:51:01.560
how things move ever since he was young, like
how to inflict a cut or exactly where a petal

01:51:01.560 --> 01:51:02.560
would fall.

01:51:02.560 --> 01:51:06.820
His moto is one of waiting as good things
are bound to come to those who wait.

01:51:06.820 --> 01:51:11.320
Gantetsusai then senses that he is up to something
but can't seem to tell what his intentions

01:51:11.320 --> 01:51:12.320
are.

01:51:12.320 --> 01:51:19.050
Over with the grrrazy stalker gf, Shija explains
to Gabimaru that due to Iwagakure's influence,

01:51:19.050 --> 01:51:22.840
no matter how hard someone craves a normal
life, its simply unattainable.

01:51:22.840 --> 01:51:26.989
The chiefs daughter is no exception at all,
she possesses no emotions and has been merely

01:51:26.989 --> 01:51:31.420
set up to fake a relationship with him as
a way to hide the atrocities he commits.

01:51:31.420 --> 01:51:36.260
Her smile, taste’s, all is a deception crafted
to imprison his mind.

01:51:36.260 --> 01:51:40.210
Cutting off the mental stuff going on right
now as I needa point out how cracked Yuki

01:51:40.210 --> 01:51:50.040
is again, this here is a representation of
Bunraku theater 

01:51:50.040 --> 01:51:52.820
and the bodies are usually controlled by 3
different people.

01:51:52.820 --> 01:51:57.400
Its just perfect imagery to show just how
manipulated and controlled Gabi’s life has

01:51:57.400 --> 01:51:58.400
been.

01:51:58.400 --> 01:52:02.510
With this in mind, she begs for Gabimaru to
revert back to his former self and throw away

01:52:02.510 --> 01:52:04.380
any idea of a normal life.

01:52:04.380 --> 01:52:08.719
After hearing Shija out, Sagiri awkwardly
smiles as she looks up at Gabimaru standing

01:52:08.719 --> 01:52:09.750
back up.

01:52:09.750 --> 01:52:17.760
Like Sagiri suspected all our boy needed was
the confirmation that she does indeed exist.

01:52:17.760 --> 01:52:22.760
We know his Tao explodes whenever his wife
is mentioned, and for him these feelings are

01:52:22.760 --> 01:52:24.910
tied to strength and weakness.

01:52:24.910 --> 01:52:28.659
Due to that and because of how hells paradise
the dual forces of Yin and Yang can effect

01:52:28.659 --> 01:52:30.520
someone's body and mind alike.

01:52:30.520 --> 01:52:34.590
His body is then shown recovering after his
Tao becomes stabilized from the confirmation

01:52:34.590 --> 01:52:39.079
he received of his wife truly existing.

01:52:39.079 --> 01:52:43.219
Gabimaru remembers the words Yui imparted
to him, that this is the battle we call life

01:52:43.219 --> 01:52:46.550
and its important to preserve a little normalcy
at all times.

01:52:46.550 --> 01:52:50.219
Confidently he tells Shija that he always
knew his dream would come with a price, but

01:52:50.219 --> 01:52:54.420
now he’s ready to search for a new normal
life with her by his side.

01:52:54.420 --> 01:53:00.489
With his body back to normal, Gabimaru boldly
states to Shija that they will not have an

01:53:00.489 --> 01:53:04.610
advantage over him and will not allow them
to get in his way no matter what.

01:53:04.610 --> 01:53:08.660
This causes Shija to remember their past confrontation
with him when they were children where he

01:53:08.660 --> 01:53:12.790
states the exact same thing, get in my way
and ill take you out.

01:53:12.790 --> 01:53:17.820
Shija like the mental case she is then becomes
overjoyed with Gabimaru's newfound attitude,

01:53:17.820 --> 01:53:20.329
screaming that this is indeed perfect.

01:53:20.329 --> 01:53:24.329
In a past memory, Yui explains to Gabimaru
how to properly prepare chestnuts.

01:53:24.329 --> 01:53:28.670
After Gabimaru questions the point behind
it all, Yui tells him that she doesn't quiet

01:53:28.670 --> 01:53:32.760
understand herself, she just wanted to try
the normal way since growing up in Iwa wasn't

01:53:32.760 --> 01:53:34.270
normal at all.

01:53:34.270 --> 01:53:38.630
The two then sit down together to eat chestnut
rice which Yui says that she found to be "very

01:53:38.630 --> 01:53:40.070
delicious and sweet".

01:53:40.070 --> 01:53:43.770
Gabimaru though staring at his plate just
wonders if it really was since he wouldn't

01:53:43.770 --> 01:53:45.730
know due to how his sense of taste is dulled.

01:53:45.730 --> 01:53:50.870
Yui who’s sadly in the same situation then
tells him that by saying it out loud they

01:53:50.870 --> 01:53:51.870
can at least pretend to be normal.

01:53:51.870 --> 01:53:53.449
So for anyone who wanted to know, the dish
Yui made is called Kurigohan or chestnut rice.

01:53:53.449 --> 01:53:54.449
Its a traditional autumn dish in japan that
adds a hint of sweetness to an otherwise basic

01:53:54.449 --> 01:53:55.449
meal.

01:53:55.449 --> 01:53:56.449
I just wanted to make the scene slightly sadder,
the fact they couldn't even taste the change

01:53:56.449 --> 01:53:57.449
in food is rough.

01:53:57.449 --> 01:53:58.449
In the present and during the current battle,
Gabimaru manages to inflict grievous damage

01:53:58.449 --> 01:53:59.449
to Shija, who with a smile on her face realizes
that he is now fighting just like he did in

01:53:59.449 --> 01:54:00.449
his hey-day and assumes its since he isn't
being held back by the flowers effects anymore.

01:54:00.449 --> 01:54:01.449
Gabimaru says that he has not lost his battle
instincts, its just that the battlefield in

01:54:01.449 --> 01:54:04.050
general for him has changed, referring to
his memories of how he could not understand

01:54:04.050 --> 01:54:05.810
his wife's struggle.

01:54:05.810 --> 01:54:09.719
At first he never understood why she would
do something so random, it just seemed like

01:54:09.719 --> 01:54:11.619
meaningless drudgery to him.

01:54:11.619 --> 01:54:15.539
What was the point of the food, the normalcy,
he could never seem to figure it out.

01:54:15.539 --> 01:54:19.599
Looking up into his eyes, Shija figures out
that Gabimaru's "love" has no clear signs

01:54:19.599 --> 01:54:23.040
of weaknesses, and in a last ditch effort
attacks with everything that was taught to

01:54:23.040 --> 01:54:24.040
them by Gabi.

01:54:24.040 --> 01:54:26.790
Darting at him, she tries to strike his vitals,
but to no avail.

01:54:26.790 --> 01:54:30.410
Throwing a kick, Gabi effortlessly leans back
out of the way, before blocking a follow up

01:54:30.410 --> 01:54:31.800
strike thrown by her.

01:54:31.800 --> 01:54:35.960
Jumping back, she remembers the time Gabi
told her she’d never be able to master ascetic

01:54:35.960 --> 01:54:40.889
blaze, before pulling her hand upto her face
and releasing a huge torrent of flames.

01:54:40.889 --> 01:54:45.250
After using her own ascetic blaze, Shija boosts
forth, pushing the flames aside and somehow

01:54:45.250 --> 01:54:47.580
managing to stab Gabimaru's heart.

01:54:47.580 --> 01:54:53.580
Nonchalantly looking down at his injury Gabimaru
applauses Shija for her adept use of the ability,

01:54:53.580 --> 01:54:56.560
explaining that if he was still human they
might've just killed him.

01:54:56.560 --> 01:55:00.710
Now though and because he’s making it home
no matter what he grabs her hand, pulls her

01:55:00.710 --> 01:55:06.099
in close and activates Ninpō: Ascetic blaze,
FULL FIRE completely setting the duo alight.

01:55:06.099 --> 01:55:11.630
After being engulfed by Gabimaru's fire ninjutsu,
Shija thinks back over her sad existence,

01:55:11.630 --> 01:55:16.199
she remembers how everyone had an admiration
for Gabi, but hers was different, something

01:55:16.199 --> 01:55:17.199
more.

01:55:17.199 --> 01:55:20.920
Wondering what it was she felt, she thinks
about the time she fled from Gabi when they

01:55:20.920 --> 01:55:24.880
were children and questions if the reason
was because she feared that she might’ve

01:55:24.880 --> 01:55:25.880
died.

01:55:25.880 --> 01:55:29.810
As time slowly moved forth Shija caught wind
of Gabimaru being married to Yui and tries

01:55:29.810 --> 01:55:33.489
to mirror her appearance by burning the right
side of their face.

01:55:33.489 --> 01:55:37.889
In all reality though she's known for a while
that the pounding of her heart wasn't born

01:55:37.889 --> 01:55:43.510
from admiration, nor from dread, but sadly
the time for that to had indeed passed.

01:55:43.510 --> 01:55:47.230
Having collapsed to the ground with a smile
on her face, Shija with their last bit of

01:55:47.230 --> 01:55:52.540
strength creates a large whistle from their
hair and signals all of the Iwagakure shinobi.

01:55:52.540 --> 01:55:56.469
Asking what the signal was for, its revealed
that it was infact a cleansing ritual, one

01:55:56.469 --> 01:56:00.770
to clear the path forth for Gabi and the last
Ninpo she’ll ever use.

01:56:00.770 --> 01:56:05.120
They also tell him that Yui is indeed alive
and awaiting his return, apparently the chief

01:56:05.120 --> 01:56:11.989
hadn't planned to do anything until after
they returned.

01:56:11.989 --> 01:56:16.640
With their last breath, Shija asks Gabimaru,
that if she's ever reborn, in sickness and

01:56:16.640 --> 01:56:22.889
in health, until death do us part, would he
face them once more, to which he answers yes

01:56:22.889 --> 01:56:24.950
with a smile.

01:56:24.950 --> 01:56:31.610
Shija happily thanks Gabimaru for his answer
and wishes them luck in his future battles.

01:56:31.610 --> 01:56:46.490
Everyone thoughts on Shija?

01:56:46.490 --> 01:56:50.449
Moving forth now, Sagiri rolls over to Gabimaru
and is told by him that they need to re-focus

01:56:50.449 --> 01:56:54.010
their attention back onto destroying the tanden
while it is still regenerating.

01:56:54.010 --> 01:56:58.080
With everyone around being in the prime position,
Yuzuriha sounds off the next signal and all

01:56:58.080 --> 01:57:01.619
four teams simultaneously prepare to destroy
the tandens.

01:57:01.619 --> 01:57:05.180
Over with the big chillers though, Jikka begins
getting back up on his feet after sensing

01:57:05.180 --> 01:57:08.679
that the timing is right for him and Gantetsusai
to destroy the Banko.

01:57:08.679 --> 01:57:14.969
Yeeet as Big G himself begins to stand, he
states that things might be slightly difficult,

01:57:14.969 --> 01:57:19.310
revealing the titan sized Banko that had begun
taking on a new transformation.

01:57:19.310 --> 01:57:26.340
In preparation to take on the transformed
monster, Jikka begins tossing off his clothing,

01:57:26.340 --> 01:57:31.640
as a way to maintain his spiritual focus,
and asks Gantetsusai for his sword.

01:57:31.640 --> 01:57:34.880
Gantetsusai finds it odd he doesn't have a
strong enough weapon to cut down the Zhu Jin-fused

01:57:34.880 --> 01:57:39.130
Banko, but, after looking at his surroundings
and witnessing bodies of Zhu Jin sprouting

01:57:39.130 --> 01:57:43.710
out of vines, Gantetsusai chooses to follow
with Jikka's plan and gives him his sword.

01:57:43.710 --> 01:57:48.520
Yo this part is actually mental, like this
dude is him.

01:57:48.520 --> 01:57:52.579
Using his own special intuition, Jikka senses
all the fatally wrong moves he could make

01:57:52.579 --> 01:57:55.100
as he walks forth to take out the monster.

01:57:55.100 --> 01:57:59.190
Eventually after casually strolling past countless
spots where he’d die in an instant, Jikka

01:57:59.190 --> 01:58:03.080
comes to a good position with the right factors
like wind and presence around him to take

01:58:03.080 --> 01:58:04.829
down the monster.

01:58:04.829 --> 01:58:09.860
Finding that all is in sync now, Jikka swings
Gantetsusai's sword and successfully cuts

01:58:09.860 --> 01:58:14.290
down the head of the Zhu Jin-fused Banko from
a distance, just like he did in the past with

01:58:14.290 --> 01:58:16.060
the ocean monster.

01:58:16.060 --> 01:58:20.400
Having watched this unfathomable feat Gantetsusai
becomes astonished and remembers the time

01:58:20.400 --> 01:58:24.110
that he believed defeating monsters would
lead him down to the path of legends.

01:58:24.110 --> 01:58:29.300
Standing in front of him now is exactly the
sort of man to go down in history as a God

01:58:29.300 --> 01:58:30.300
Slayer.

01:58:30.300 --> 01:58:34.719
Thinking on the past some more, he also remembers
when Fuchi freed a Dōshi and refused to explain

01:58:34.719 --> 01:58:35.719
why.

01:58:35.719 --> 01:58:39.710
As a baby clone of Zhu Jin approaches him
now, Gantetsusai states that he started to

01:58:39.710 --> 01:58:43.199
understand where Fuchi was coming from and
that fighting monsters, in order to give him

01:58:43.199 --> 01:58:46.070
a thrill in his old age, doesn't affect him
anymore.

01:58:46.070 --> 01:58:50.540
Infront of him and having walked across a
field of flowers, Jikka steps up to the tanden

01:58:50.540 --> 01:58:52.920
and prepares to destroy it.

01:58:52.920 --> 01:58:56.240
Gantetsusai tries warning him that if he should
proceed then it might also have an affect

01:58:56.240 --> 01:58:59.719
on Gabimaru and Chōbei since their Tao is
connected with the monster.

01:58:59.719 --> 01:59:04.510
Despite being told this, Jikka ignores the
risks and destroys the Tanden.

01:59:04.510 --> 01:59:10.270
With the Zhu Jin Banko's destroyed, all traces
of its remains start to slowly wilt away.

01:59:10.270 --> 01:59:15.040
However, Jikka and Gantetsusai soon realize
that the giant creature is still alive.

01:59:15.040 --> 01:59:19.210
This is due to it already being morning as
warned before by Mei, and now because of that

01:59:19.210 --> 01:59:22.829
they must take on the task of destroying the
tandens simultaneously again.

01:59:22.829 --> 01:59:27.290
Chōbei sees that the Wood tanden is beginning
to slowly regenerate from the sun and finds

01:59:27.290 --> 01:59:30.969
himself to low on stamina to make another
attempt at destroying it again.

01:59:30.969 --> 01:59:34.719
Tōma yells out suggesting to Chōbei in leaving
the monster behind and trying to find a way

01:59:34.719 --> 01:59:36.449
off the island together.

01:59:36.449 --> 01:59:40.920
In his eyes there's no reason in dying here
as that would make him no different to their

01:59:40.920 --> 01:59:41.920
father.

01:59:41.920 --> 01:59:46.320
Despite his brother's plea, Chōbei activates
his break down state one last time and uses

01:59:46.320 --> 01:59:48.099
his vines to dig into the Wood tanden.

01:59:48.099 --> 01:59:51.750
He knows he doesn't have the right attribute,
but skewering the roots with his vines will

01:59:51.750 --> 01:59:54.880
allow him to cut off the regeneration to the
main body.

01:59:54.880 --> 01:59:59.880
With only one job left, he chooses to do that
exact method with each and every location

01:59:59.880 --> 02:00:03.140
as he can fully destroy the immortal..

02:00:03.140 --> 02:00:08.011
His plan ends up becoming a success as everyone
around watches Chōbei’s vines burst through

02:00:08.011 --> 02:00:10.370
all of the Tanden in each location.

02:00:10.370 --> 02:00:17.300
One last time our Demon Bandit says breakdown
and come the hell apart... but not on himself

02:00:17.300 --> 02:00:23.390
instead on the immortal Banko which as a result,
starts to wither away.

02:00:23.390 --> 02:00:27.160
Having used up all his strength, Chōbei falls
to ground and hears his brother crying out

02:00:27.160 --> 02:00:28.160
to him.

02:00:28.160 --> 02:00:33.179
Falling into a flashback he remembers the
time he held Tōma as a baby and how he felt

02:00:33.179 --> 02:00:37.949
like he could break apart at any second, but
still grabbed onto him for dear life.

02:00:37.949 --> 02:00:42.190
Once realizing that he must protect him as
his older brother, Chōbei with tears in his

02:00:42.190 --> 02:00:46.790
eyes says that he protected him, because thats
what big brothers do.

02:00:46.790 --> 02:00:51.540
In the afterlife, Chōbei kneels down before
his parents and apologizes for the sins he

02:00:51.540 --> 02:00:55.580
had committed in his life but was happy to
know that he was at least a good brother.

02:00:55.580 --> 02:01:02.731
A young Chōbei then runs to his parents with
open arms as his life comes to an end... randomly

02:01:02.731 --> 02:01:07.820
though and breaking through the light, he
notices a hand reached out to him.

02:01:07.820 --> 02:01:12.660
After the passing of his older brother, Tōma
kneels down in grief while holding on to what

02:01:12.660 --> 02:01:14.219
seems like a plant ovule.

02:01:14.219 --> 02:01:18.470
Meanwhile, Mei and Yuzuriha run out of the
temple, while complaining about the foul odor

02:01:18.470 --> 02:01:23.560
in the air, and encounter Gui Fa as a child
who’s holding on to this random Basin/Urn

02:01:23.560 --> 02:05:49.910
looking thing.

